s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/cfb2fc5821ce72a2d487892f5aaa61969035e418/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:21:56Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:23:34Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"feat(academics): make Edit Guardian work\n\nNothing consumed editGuardianId, so the Edit Guardian action on a student''s\nFamily tab was inert — the control was present and did nothing.\n\nAdds EditGuardianModal, wired from the canEdit modals fragment on the student\nprofile route. It hydrates from the guardian matched by guardianId and submits\nthe WHOLE guardians array with only that entry replaced, spreading the stored\nguardian so guardianId, hasPortalAccess and fields the form does not expose\nsurvive the write.\n\nRELEASE ORDERING, not a merge gate: this must not reach production ahead of\nthe backend deploy carrying edforge#503. It submits the whole guardians array\nthrough updateStudent, and until #503 lands that write replaces the array\nwholesale. It adds no NEW class of risk — the shipped AddGuardianModal already\nappends to that array today — but it does add a second way to trigger it.\n\nOnly Modal/ModalFooter/Button are stubbed in the tests; the form controls are\nthe real @edforge/ui primitives, matching the EditDemographicsModal pattern.\n\ni18n: en + ne only. origin/main carries no other locales; the in-flight locale\nsprint reconciles parity for whichever of the two lands second.\n\nPart of #500","tree":{"sha":"5e6c502e82d367a82c9b58dde467f9789e778201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/5e6c502e82d367a82c9b58dde467f9789e778201"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/cfb2fc5821ce72a2d487892f5aaa61969035e418","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/cfb2fc5821ce72a2d487892f5aaa61969035e418","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKGNmYjJmYzU4MjFjZTcyYTJkNDg3ODkyZjVhYWE2MTk2OTAzNWU0MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/3c43b47948c92f5dfccfe03ed35fab25de76a771","sha":"3c43b47948c92f5dfccfe03ed35fab25de76a771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/3c43b47948c92f5dfccfe03ed35fab25de76a771"}],"sha":"cfb2fc5821ce72a2d487892f5aaa61969035e418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/cfb2fc5821ce72a2d487892f5aaa61969035e418"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/cdff3d47f5293da3b2e513a1f674206f4f1141b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T20:21:56Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:21:37Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(finance): mint the payment idempotency key once per drawer-open\n\nThe submit handler called crypto.randomUUID() inline in the mutation payload,\nproducing a fresh key per ATTEMPT rather than per form submission.\n\nrecordPayment.isPending blocks the double-click, but a retry after a network\ntimeout — the exact scenario idempotency exists for — sent a DIFFERENT key and\nbooked a second payment however correct the server was. This is the half of\nedforge#501 that actually reaches production: the backend sentinel is\nnecessary but not sufficient without it.\n\nThe key is now minted once into a ref, reset in the existing closed-to-open\neffect alongside the other field resets, and reused across retries within one\ndrawer-open.\n\nTests pin both halves: the key is STABLE across two submits in one\ndrawer-open, and REGENERATED after close/reopen so a genuine second payment\nis not swallowed as a replay. Asserting only the first would pass on a\nhardcoded constant.\n\nedforge#501 cannot be closed until this and the backend PR both ship.\n\nPart of #500","tree":{"sha":"7a824a163ca8ae2d73a34d978a120cc811ebc98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/7a824a163ca8ae2d73a34d978a120cc811ebc98a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/cdff3d47f5293da3b2e513a1f674206f4f1141b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.githu