a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:51:57Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:51:57Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(academics): type the contact-address test helper\n\n`defaultStudentFormData` is `Record<string, unknown>`, so structuredClone of\nits `contactInfo` is `unknown` and every property access on it is TS18046.\n\nCaught by CI, not locally: after adding the test I re-ran vitest and eslint\nbut not typecheck, and turbo''s cached result from the earlier run read as\ngreen. Re-ran the full gate with --force this time.","tree":{"sha":"07343a490026f5962c3bcbdd1fc052f0b84c78ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/07343a490026f5962c3bcbdd1fc052f0b84c78ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/efc69788e3d990a7a300afdc7e4f92ad8c59eca9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/efc69788e3d990a7a300afdc7e4f92ad8c59eca9","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKGVmYzY5Nzg4ZTNkOTkwYTdhMzAwYWZkYzdlNGY5MmFkOGM1OWVjYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16","sha":"68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16"}],"sha":"efc69788e3d990a7a300afdc7e4f92ad8c59eca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/efc69788e3d990a7a300afdc7e4f92ad8c59eca9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:45:43Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:45:43Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"test(academics): cover the address started-gate, and record what the fix does not close\n\nThe refine change that actually unblocks the Contact step shipped untested:\npayload.test.ts covers the submit mapper, not the schema the wizard validates\neach step against. These pin it directly, including the mailing-address mount\nand the fact that the schema can now represent a Nepali address at all — the\nroot cause was staleness as much as the anchor, since the pre-fix schema\nstripped province/district/municipality/ward before the refine ever saw them.\n\nThe tests also state what is deliberate and must not be \"simplified\" later:\nrouting PABSON to the Nepal form, locking country to NPL (Sprint A.8), and\nrequiring a street once an address is genuinely being given. None of those was\nthe defect.\n\nAlso records the one cost of this approach. Because the mapper cannot tell the\nmachine-written country from an operator-selected one, a GENERIC operator who\npicks only a country now has it dropped silently where it used to raise a\nstreet error. Accepted: a lone country is not an address and the backend would\nreject it regardless, so the alternatives are a confusing error or a 400.\nDistinguishing the two needs the archetype threaded into both the mapper and\nthe step schema, which is a larger change than this fix warrants.","tree":{"sha":"02f6b08cc4686c919b3cf9546d3900d265696a47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/02f6b08cc4686c919b3cf9546d3900d265696a47"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDY4NDI2YWVjZGZmOWFjYWVjZDE0Yzg0YWMyNmUyYWNkNTQxNTBkMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/15509c624b7dd01f6c9d9f1d98ec6a7847f1c8c9","sha":"15509c624b7dd01f6c9d9f1d98ec6a7847f1c8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/15509c624b7dd01f6c9d9f1d98ec6a7847f1c8c9"}],"sha":"68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/68426aecdff9acaecd14c84ac26e2acd54150d16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/15509c624b7dd01f6c9d9f1d98ec6a7847f1c8c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:15:50Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:15:50Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(academics): stop the enrolment wizard sending values the operator never entered\n\nThree defects share one root cause: the wizard seeds its inputs with empty\nstrings (and, for PABSON, a locked country) so React keeps them controlled,\nthen submits that seed as if it were operator input.\n\n#366 — guardian rows went to the wire completely unprocessed, so every blank\noptional arrived as ''''. The backend rejects '''' for anything with a format:\nphoneType is a z.enum and email is .email(). phoneType was the reported 400;\nemail fails identically for any guardian without an email address and had\nnot been hit yet only because the tester filled it in. The student''s own\ncontactInfo, twelve lines above in the same function, was already normalised\n— guardians never were.\n\n#367 — AddressFieldsNepal locks country to ''NPL'' on mount, and the address\nrefine counted country as operator input, so an untouched address block\ndemanded a street line. country is no longer an anchor on either side: the\nform schema stops requiring street1 for it, and a country-only address is\ndropped from the payload rather than sent, which would otherwise trip the\nidentical refine in the shared addressSchema.\n\n#368 — cleanAddress allow-listed six US-shaped keys and silently dropped\nprovince, district, municipality and ward. The allow-list was correct when\nwritten and became a deny-list the moment Sprint A.1 added the Nepal fields,\nso a complete Nepali address was accepted, reported as saved, and stored\nempty.\n\nThe mappers move out of the component into payload.ts. All three defects\nwere invisible to a render test and only show up in the bytes that leave the\nwizard, so the tests assert the request shape directly; each one was\nmutation-checked against a reintroduction of the bug it covers.\n\nCloses #366\nCloses #367\nCloses #368","tree":{"sha":"b08a621fee82e1627b6b02666cc14c4ade565dc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/b08a621fee82e1627b6b02666cc14c4ade565dc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/15509c624b7dd01f6c9d9f1d98ec6a7847f1c8c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"