854ea0e36841f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/aae31a9945266b539a12c66228c854ea0e36841f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e","sha":"67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e"}],"sha":"be7a4931a83d5927c78c020ccef1cd0492771521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/be7a4931a83d5927c78c020ccef1cd0492771521"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:34:14Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:34:14Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(finance): label the agreement line, mark the replaced fee\n\nFollow-up to #352, which I introduced and which is live.\n\nExpanding a student row on the bulk-generate review step showed the raw\ntranslation key:\n\n  Grade 3 Annual School Fee   NPR 18,000.00\n  bulkGenerate.agreementLine  NPR 12,000.00\n  Invoice total               NPR 12,000.00\n\nTwo mistakes, both mine.\n\nThe agreement line carried an i18n key as its `name` on the assumption the\nrenderer would translate it. The renderer prints `line.name` directly, so\nthe key reached the screen. The data layer no longer carries a key at all:\nthe line is identified by `isAgreement` and the renderer supplies the label,\nso an untranslated string cannot leak this way again.\n\nThe replaced catalog fee rendered its full NPR 18,000 with nothing to say it\nis not being charged, directly above a NPR 12,000 total. It now renders\nstruck through with a \"Replaced\" badge. Keeping the catalog amount visible\nis deliberate — the operator should see what the agreement displaced, the\nway the invoice provenance panel names suppressed fees — but it has to be\nlegible as displaced rather than billed.\n\nNew keys `agreementLine` and `replacedBadge` in en and ne.\n\nThe totals were always correct; this is presentation only. The unit tests\npassed because compute.ts is pure math and nothing covered how the row\nrenders — which is why this only surfaced in the production walkthrough.\nTwo regression assertions added: the agreement line carries no key, and the\nreplaced fee is flagged with base intact and total zero.\n\nGates: build:packages 13/13, typecheck 30/30, vitest 223 files / 1,545\ntests, eslint 0 errors.","tree":{"sha":"18bc281d5fbf079d70b2a4ee3e4e58e01ed5d98d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/18bc281d5fbf079d70b2a4ee3e4e58e01ed5d98d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDY3YmQ3OTMyNmFhYTdjZmJkYTBmM2I2ZTg0YjAxNzVhM2Y0OTU4MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/aae31a9945266b539a12c66228c854ea0e36841f","sha":"aae31a9945266b539a12c66228c854ea0e36841f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/aae31a9945266b539a12c66228c854ea0e36841f"}],"sha":"67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/67bd79326aaa7cfbda0f3b6e84b0175a3f49580e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sho