e3303542d4ea8a88c2b0d569941dc3d3b1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/de43e3303542d4ea8a88c2b0d569941dc3d3b1b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/d8e4270081c13438f9d6addda70fe9357d9259f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:23:36Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:23:36Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(finance): bulk wizard totals agreement-covered students at agreement prices\n\nFrontend half of #465. Stacked on #347 (both change the bulk wizard).\n\nThe wizard priced every student from the fee catalog, so two siblings on a\nNPR 20,000 agreement previewed at NPR 33,000 — a 65% overstatement of what\ngeneration would bill. It labelled them \"Agreement\" while showing the\ncatalog number, so the preview contradicted itself.\n\nThe projection now consumes what bulk-preview reports about each student''s\nagreement: which requested fee structures it replaces, and for how much.\nThose values come from the same backend code the generate path bills with,\nso the number the operator confirms is the number that gets billed.\n\n- `computeStudentInvoice` accepts an optional per-student agreement\n  projection. A suppressed catalog fee stays visible at zero rather than\n  disappearing, so the operator can see what the agreement displaced, and\n  the replacement is added as its own line.\n- `computeBatch` takes a studentId → projection map, threaded from the\n  preview query in Step 4.\n- Fees the agreement does not cover keep their catalog price, and custom\n  lines still add on top.\n\nAbsent projection data — preview still loading, agreements flag off, or the\nbackend omitted the fields — falls back to catalog pricing, which is the\nprevious behaviour exactly.\n\nThe new tests live in `compute.agreement.test.ts` rather than being appended\nto the neighbouring `compute.spec.ts`, because CI runs `pnpm vitest run`\nfrom the root and the root config only collects `*.test.{ts,tsx}`. The three\n`*.spec.*` files in that directory never run in CI; filed separately rather\nthan widened here, since widening the root glob also sweeps in the Playwright\ne2e specs.\n\nGates: build:packages 13/13, typecheck 30/30, root vitest 223 files / 1,531\ntests green with the new file collected, eslint 0 errors.","tree":{"sha":"d090f0ca06ee762816982e45ac373fbb0b1b53a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/d090f0ca06ee762816982e45ac373fbb0b1b53a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/d8e4270081c13438f9d6addda70fe9357d9259f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/d8e4270081c13438f9d6addda70fe9357d9259f4","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKGQ4ZTQyNzAwODFjMTM0MzhmOWQ2YWRkZGE3MGZlOTM1N2Q5MjU5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/e8cf97f012ae68a69b5ab5c87d574cc8ba79bae9","sha":"e8cf97f012ae68a69b5ab5c87d574cc8ba79bae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/e8cf97f012ae68a69b5ab5c87d574cc8ba79bae9"}],"sha":"d8e4270081c13438f9d6addda70fe9357d9259f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/d8e4270081c13438f9d6addda70fe9357d9259f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/e8cf97f012ae68a69b5ab5c87d574cc8ba79bae9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:11:37Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:11:37Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(finance): send the required Idempotency-Key on bulk invoice generation\n\nCloses #347.\n\nThe bulk-generate route is `@Idempotent()` on the server. That decorator\nboth REQUIRES an `Idempotency-Key` header and uses it to collapse a double\nsubmit. The client never sent one, so every bulk generation failed:\n\n  POST /finance/schools/<id>/invoices/bulk-generate → 400\n  \"This endpoint requires an ''Idempotency-Key'' header (UUID v4 recommended).\"\n\nBulk generation is how a school bills a grade, and it failed 100% of the\ntime. Three of the four `@Idempotent()` routes already sent the header\n(`invoices/bulk-pdf-export`, `payments/bulk-pdf-export`,\n`student-accounts/:id/opening-balance`); only this one was missed.\n\nThe key is stable per submission rather than per attempt. Minting a fresh\nUUID on each call satisfies the header check but defeats the deduplication\nthe header exists for — pressing Generate twice would create two runs. The\nwizard caches the key against the serialized payload, so a repeat submit of\nthe same request reuses it while the retry-failed flow, which sends a\nnarrowed payload, correctly gets a new one. `reset()` drops it so a fresh\nwizard run is a fresh submission.\n\n`BulkGenerateOptions.idempotencyKey` is optional and defaults to a new\nUUID, so non-wizard callers stay correct without changes.\n\nThree existing assertions in bulk-generate-async-route.test.ts pinned the\nold config shape (`undefined` when not async). They now assert the header\nis present and that `params` is still absent unless async was requested.\n\nGates: build:packages, turbo typecheck 30/30, vitest 50 files / 257 tests\nacross apps/finance + packages/finance-services, eslint 0 errors. The new\nguards fail 4/4 against the previous implementation.","tree":{"sha":"b1a1ba1654bd33eee872e4a295627c33d4e93cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/b1a1ba1654bd33eee872e4a295627c33d4e93cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/e8cf97f012ae68a69b5ab5c87d574cc8ba79bae9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoai