wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/eb491710e859998083fdb08bc09a59ddbb1f5f33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:29:53Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T10:29:53Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(family-billing): reconcile with the live backend contract after the rebase\n\nBackend edforge#464 fixed GlobalExceptionFilter so 409 bodies carry the\ndomain `code` and payload (conflicts[], agreementId, existingInvoiceId).\nThe E2E fixtures here served the intended shape rather than the wire\nshape, which is why the activate-conflict and override flows were green\nin tests but unreachable in a browser.\n\n- i18n: `sidebar.agreements` in en/ne nav.json (the pre-existing\n  sidebar-i18n-coverage test failed without it; Nepali sidebar rendered\n  the English label).\n- types: Payment.invoiceId / studentAccountId are `string | null` (null\n  for multi-target family payments) with familyId? / applications?;\n  InvoiceFilterDto.billingSource drops the invalid ''mixed'';\n  FamilyOpenInvoicesResponse mirrors the backend DTO (familyId,\n  familyName, per-invoice status / currency / gradeLevel).\n- lib/agreement-errors.ts: parseAgreementActive, conflictKindFromError,\n  openInvoiceConflictsFromError moved out of the route files (react-\n  refresh rule) and rebuilt on extractApiErrorCode / extractApiErrorBody\n  readers of the wire envelope.\n- Create wizard: 409 AGREEMENT_OVERLAP on draft-create renders inline on\n  the members step (agreement.wizard.overlapConflict, en/ne).\n- E2E fixtures: every 409 is the real envelope via conflict409().\n- Tests: envelope readers, parseAgreementActive and activate-409\n  classification against the full wire body.","tree":{"sha":"a954e72cad3c1263e6ae6851f4e86ea44f78cd7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/a954e72cad3c1263e6ae6851f4e86ea44f78cd7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/eb491710e859998083fdb08bc09a59ddbb1f5f33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/eb491710e859998083fdb08bc09a59ddbb1f5f33","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKGViNDkxNzEwZTg1OTk5ODA4M2ZkYjA4YmMwOWE1OWRkYmIxZjVmMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/f0dc70a4cbef68e07b91bb885213d8d26c7f507d","sha":"f0dc70a4cbef68e07b91bb885213d8d26c7f507d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/f0dc70a4cbef68e07b91bb885213d8d26c7f507d"}],"sha":"eb491710e859998083fdb08bc09a59ddbb1f5f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/eb491710e859998083fdb08bc09a59ddbb1f5f33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/f0dc70a4cbef68e07b91bb885213d8d26c7f507d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T23:29:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:54:41Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"test(e2e): finance family-billing suite — first working finance E2E coverage\n\nNew e2e/fixtures/finance.ts (the missing finance mock layer): backend-exact\nenvelopes ({items} wrapping incl. the versions regression fence), data\nfactories, 409/400 variant injection, and {writes} capture so specs assert the\nEXACT request bodies the FE sends.\n\n7 specs / 13 tests in e2e/tests/finance/ pinning the QA checklist + every\nround-2/3 contract regression: wizard enum contracts (frequency/feeTypes on\nthe POSTed body), per-student matrix emission, inline server-400 surfacing,\nversions {items} crash fence, activate-409 conflict listing, AGREEMENT_ACTIVE\noverride dialog with/without existingInvoiceId + billing:manage role gate,\nbillingSource filter excludes ''mixed'', family payment (schoolId param, min-2\nblock, over-allocation, {familyId, applications[], amount=sum} body),\nprovenance fetch-on-expand + bypass audit, dashboard coverage tile.\n\n4 @smoke tags join the PR gate. 3 data-testids added (finance-* convention).\nValidated locally: full suite 13/13 green (6.7m). Flake-check + smoke\nregression delegated to CI (local MF dev stack too heavy to re-run).","tree":{"sha":"ecca4795e3b74e7db1d6357f96bbe939714046d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/ecca4795e3b74e7db1d6357f96bbe939714046d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/f0dc70a4cbef68e07b91bb885213d8d26c7f507d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","re