hub.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/a3b3cda440f5f64dae4cdbc1785b16dd738e9b53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T20:17:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:54:41Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(finance/academics): error surfacing, contract bounds, bulk-wizard honesty (review batch B)\n\n- record.tsx: structured 400s render inline (shared mapper) + specific toasts;\n  currency omitted (schema: inherited from invoices, mismatch 400s); bounds\n  (amount<=10M, reference<=100, notes<=500); max-20 family allocation ceiling\n  (+tests); overpay warning (backend allocates remainder to opening balance,\n  else PAYMENT_EXCEEDS_ALLOCATABLE); success screen shows receiptNumber +\n  payment id + links (was a dead end).\n- GenerateInvoiceModal: non-409 errors surface the backend message; bounds;\n  dismissal gated while pending.\n- Bulk wizard (pre-existing money-honesty bug): backend bulk schema has NO\n  discounts field -- zod silently stripped the FE''s discounts[] so previews\n  showed discounted totals while invoices billed FULL price. Removed the dead\n  field, the per-fee % input, and all discount preview math; added an explicit\n  \"discounts are not applied in bulk generation\" note. Preview now equals\n  billing. Also: dead Issue-date field removed; sync-success no longer\n  fabricates invoice numbers and now lists the backend''s real per-student\n  errors; custom-line name bounded 120 + i18n''d fallback.\n- FamilyGroupPanel/useFamily: create-family input bounds; create+link retry\n  reuses the already-created familyId (no more duplicate families); mutation\n  toasts i18n''d.\n\n575 tests green; tsc 0 x4; eslint 0 errors; en/ne parity (payments 1266=1266).","tree":{"sha":"d683d0ba03417c23bfdfa215987d515361f27f4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/d683d0ba03417c23bfdfa215987d515361f2