rivacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/e90a1dc800adefc2956069baa7c81ca47ad3f99d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T19:50:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:54:40Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(agreements): rebuild create wizard against the real backend contract (live-QA P0s)\n\nLive user testing proved the wizard was written against an imagined contract:\n- billingFrequency offered invalid ''termly''/''annually'' and OMITTED the valid\n  ''annual'' -> options are now exactly the backend feeFrequencyEnum.\n- coveredFeeTypes was freeform text (\"Overall School Fee\" -> 400) -> now a\n  checkbox-chip multi-select over the 10 feeTypeEnum values, via a new shared\n  fee-types module reused by FeeStructureForm (single vocabulary).\n- per_student terms held ONE line per student, structurally unable to satisfy\n  the backend''s (studentId x coveredFeeType) completeness matrix -> matrix\n  cell model keyed studentId|feeType; buildCreateDto emits the full matrix.\n- line feeType was \"optional\" freeform -> required, from the covered set.\n- Server 400s (structured errors[] with per-field paths) were collapsed into\n  a bare \"Validation failed\" toast -> new lib/api-validation-errors mapper\n  renders backend messages inline and jumps to the offending step.\n- Client validation now mirrors backend bounds (title 160, payer name 120,\n  phone 20, email format, familyId UUID, allocations strictly positive,\n  0.01 sum tolerance); currency + notes threaded into the DTO.\n- Activate-409 banner lists the actual conflicting invoices (number,\n  matched fee types, total) instead of a bare count; fixed the allocation-row\n  layout clash that clipped student ids behind the amount input.\n\n28 new unit tests (mapper vs the live 400 body; matrix/validation/DTO).\n234 finance tests green; tsc 0; eslint 0 errors; en/ne parity 1259=1259.","tree":{"sha":"221384359e0e1e1502ec9814e1d6cd59d6aa29dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/221384359e0e1e1502ec9814e1d6cd59d6aa29dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/e90a1dc800adefc2956069baa7c81ca47ad3f99d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/e90a1dc800adefc2956069baa7c81ca47ad3f99d","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKGU5MGExZGM4MDBhZGVmYzI5NTYwNjliYWE3YzgxY2E0N2FkM2Y5OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/7992068845e3dcabf628d51a577835639a3a9234","sha":"7992068845e3dcabf628d51a577835639a3a9234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/7992068845e3dcabf628d51a577835639a3a9234"}],"sha":"e90a1dc800adefc2956069baa7c81ca47ad3f99d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/e90a1dc800adefc2956069baa7c81ca47ad3f99d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/7992068845e3dcabf628d51a577835639a3a9234/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T17:45:33Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T09:54:40Z","email":"rainshoaib2013@outlook.com","name":"Shoaib Rain"},"message":"fix(family-billing): crash + 11 review findings (data-fetch shapes vs backend)\n\nIndependent FE-vs-backend review found real defects the first pass missed:\n\n- CRASH (screenshot): getAgreementVersions treated the backend''s { items }\n  envelope as a bare array -> [...versions] \"t is not iterable\" on the agreement\n  detail page. Unwrap .items + defensive spread + regression tests.\n- P0: getStudentFamily omitted the REQUIRED ?schoolId -> 400 on every call ->\n  FB-1.8 family panel AND FB-4.8 family payment both dead. Threaded schoolId\n  through both services (academics + finance), both useStudentFamily hooks\n  (key + enabled gate), FamilyGroupPanel, and both URL-guard tests.\n- P1: bulk-preview read `perStudent` but backend emits `students` -> per-student\n  billing-source chips never rendered. Renamed FE field + read site.\n- P1: invoices `billingSource=mixed` filter -> backend 400 (accepts only\n  agreement/standard) -> list silently emptied. Removed the invalid option +\n  surfaced the previously-swallowed list error.\n- P1: single-invoice family payment -> backend applications.min(2) 400. Block\n  pre-flight with a specific message (family mode needs >=2 invoices).\n- P2: activate 409 conflict count read a nonexistent field (always 0) -> read\n  conflicts.length. P2: race/double-submit 409 lacks existingInvoiceId ->\n  override dialog never opened -> gate on code+agreementId, link optional.\n  P2: add-member 409 (one-family invariant) targeted messaging + orphan note.\n- nit: removed UpdateFamilyDto.version the backend ignores.\n\n471 FE tests green; tsc clean (types/finance-services/finance/academics);\neslint 0 errors; en/ne i18n parity.","tree":{"sha":"eaa0ef586cce5c113f08f0dce1e2edc73c7e73f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/eaa0ef586cce5c113f08f0dce1e2edc73c7e73f8"},"url":"https://api.github.c