irm + reason.\nFB-2.9: AgreementCreateWizard (3 steps: family/members -> terms ->\nreview) mirroring the bulk-generate state machine. Client-side invariant\nvalidation mirrors the backend superRefine (<=30 students, >=1 covered\nfeeType, effectiveFrom<To, fixed_total allocation sums to total with live\nsum) so operators get immediate feedback pre-400; submit also gated by\nusePermission(''manage'',''billing''). Router: create BEFORE\n(ordering trap). i18n agreement.* en+ne parity. 0 eslint errors, finance\n+ shell typecheck clean, vitest + M0 URL guards green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8df6b0f704c6157a5eadb5c2206e4f9ea69826de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/8df6b0f704c6157a5eadb5c2206e4f9ea69826de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/7f1eb70761f06f9a175526a1dc1e29aa37b39e42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain","user_view_type":"publi