 MFE)\n\nA new ''Family Group / Siblings'' section inside the existing profile\nFamily tab (Option A — tab NOT renamed; the existing Family tab stays\nguardians+emergency-contacts). Consumes M0''s useFamily hooks:\n- View: useStudentFamily -> family name + primary contact + siblings\n  (name, grade, status chip); subject tagged ''(This student)''; not-linked\n  empty state with a Link CTA.\n- Link (modal, SegmentedControl): search existing families\n  (useFamilies namePrefix) OR create new (useCreateFamily) then\n  useAddFamilyMember; both close+invalidate on success.\n- Unlink: destructive confirm modal -> useRemoveFamilyMember.\nschoolId threaded StudentProfilePage(useActiveSchoolId) -> FamilyTab ->\npanel. Design tokens + @edforge/ui primitives + UuidBadge (no id.slice);\ni18n family.group.* en+ne (parity verified). 6 render tests; academics\nsuite 263 green; eslint 0 errors; typecheck clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"787eab6bdb4ff3f8b780a9092e3f6c2d8c6a7847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/787eab6bdb4ff3f8b780a9092e3f6c2d8c6a7847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/b295cff252ad79257cf1fb52ec322ffd9820962b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59787578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain","id":59787578,"login":"shoaibrain","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5Nzg3NTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoaibrain/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoai