@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:28:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(people): admin ''Terminate all sessions'' in staff detail (Sprint 4 / S4.6)\n\nCompletes Sprint 4''s admin session oversight FE. The staff-detail security tab\nalready lists a user''s sessions; this adds the admin terminate-all action.\n\n- people.service: revokeUserSessions(userId) -> POST /sessions/user/:id/revoke-all\n  (the sessions-module admin surface, which kills the target''s Cognito refresh\n  tokens — the S4.2 teeth deployed today — unlike the security-surface list).\n- staff/detail security tab: ''Terminate all sessions'' button in the Active\n  Sessions header, gated on usePermission(''delete'',''staff'') (TenantAdmin-only:\n  Principal has manage but not delete, TenantAdmin short-circuits) to match the\n  backend''s TenantAdmin requirement. Confirm modal -> mutation -> toast +\n  invalidate the sessions query. en + ne i18n.\n\nTests: route-shape guards pin both surfaces (list=security, terminate=teeth).\n2 guard tests pass; people route tests 8 green; typecheck + lint clean.\n\nSurface split (list vs terminate) is the tracked S-DEBT-1; not consolidating here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d32973f6dda40cf6f2b7e099b0bfc17d8242f23e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/d32973f6dda40cf6f2b7e099b0bfc17d8242f23e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/777e71f22b29eaeba13e037e551057ede2c3f6a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user