om/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/d41c73cb5771ff0b1c78cc0c8cccecee9d15ccf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:57:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:13:31Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(landing): human-recorded hero montage — real operator driving the product\n\nReplace the scripted hero with a 30s edit of a founder-recorded walkthrough\n(9 beats, hard cuts, loop fades): Home with the needs-attention alert and live\ntrend tooltip → students roster → a student''s profile incl. the Family/guardians\ntab → finance overview → dark-mode invoices with dual AD/BS due dates → invoice\ndetail → student accounts → payments ledger. 1600x1000 (16:10), muted, 1.1MB.\n\nCut from a VFR QuickTime capture via a CFR 30fps intermediate; sidebar cropped\nout for a content-focused frame. Every span where the account menu or the\nRecord Payment drawer exposed a personal email was excluded, and all beat\nframes were QA''d (no PII, no skeletons, English UI only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56976c5bcc2eb0b68d12570201f3a9eac805a130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/56976c5bcc2eb0b68d12570201f3a9eac805a130"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/d41c73cb5771ff0b1c78cc0c8cccecee9d15ccf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_ur