ers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/29f2edd213735a8f1260c9a9366ab13b4cb40907/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T01:21:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T01:21:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(landing): directed video montages for all four landing sections\n\nReplace the single-scroll footage with directed, scene-spliced recordings of the\nreal product (synthetic-data demo tenant), shot via the scene engine in\nscripts/record-landing.mjs — visible synthetic cursor, real interactions (KPI\nhovers, chart-tooltip sweeps, roster row click → student drawer slide-in,\nprofile tab click), hard cuts between scenes, no loading dead-air:\n\n- platform-overview.mp4 (774K, 35s hero loop, 1.25x pace): 7-scene montage —\n  Home KPIs → attendance trend sweep → Academics at-risk → roster + student\n  drawer → curriculum → finance collection → back to Home so the loop closes\n  where it opens.\n- district.mp4 (432K, 21s): KPI band → at-risk visibility → drill into one\n  student. Chapters 0/7/14, mediaLength 0:21.\n- teachers.mp4 (233K, 17s) NEW: classrooms → child''s record → Family tab with\n  guardians. Section flipped to showMode=\"video\"; feature rail rewritten to the\n  shipped story (classrooms / child record / guardians) — the messaging and\n  auto-translation chapters are gone (deferred features stay off camera).\n  Chapters 0/8/14, mediaLength 0:17.\n- students.mp4 (261K, 18s) NEW: roster sparklines → one complete record →\n  curriculum. Rail rewritten to the records story (attendance trend / complete\n  IEMIS-ready record / curriculum); heading now \"Every student, fully seen.\"\n  Chapters 0/9/13, mediaLength 0:18.\n- task-router.mp4 (stock) deleted; LANDING_VIDEOS now carries only real footage.\n- Section tests + config test updated in lockstep with the new copy/keys.\n\nKnown demo-data caveat: \"Today''s attendance 1.6%\" appears in Home/Academics\nshots because the demo tenant has no attendance recorded today; reshoot via\nscripts/record-landing.mjs after recording attendance in the demo tenant.\n\nGates: turbo typecheck pass, lint 0 errors, vitest landing-v2 194/194.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"820c40f29e47be2ed5723f8179f23161ca11a36b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/820c40f29e47be2ed5723f8179f23161ca11a36b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/29f2edd213735a8f1260c9a9366ab13b4cb40907","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/29f2edd213735a8f1260c9a9366ab13b4cb40907","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDI5ZjJlZGQyMTM3MzVhOGYxMjYwYzlhOTM2NmFiMTNiNGNiNDA5MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b","sha":"487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b"}],"sha":"29f2edd213735a8f1260c9a9366ab13b4cb40907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/29f2edd213735a8f1260c9a9366ab13b4cb40907"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T00:56:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T00:56:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(landing): entity/address cleanup, drop language claims, scene-based recorder\n\nHonesty + branding fixes across both landing generations (v2 sections and the\nv1 public pages still routed at /about /contact /privacy):\n\n- Entity is \"EdForge Technologies\" everywhere — \"LLC\"/\"Inc.\" removed from the\n  v2 footer strings, v1 footer, About, and Privacy pages.\n- McKinney, TX street address removed from About and Contact.\n- \"40+ languages / auto-translation\" claims removed (Teachers feature,\n  Communications pillar, FAQ). Replaced with what is live today: the interface\n  ships in English and Nepali, more planned. Communications pillar reframed as\n  in-development.\n\nscripts/record-landing.mjs rewritten as a scene-based montage engine:\n- Injects a synthetic macOS-style cursor that follows the automated mouse, so\n  glides/hovers/clicks are visible in footage (headless captures have no OS\n  cursor — the previous hero read as a static image).\n- Scene lists with real read-only interactions (KPI hovers, chart tooltip\n  sweeps, roster scrolls); hero montage cuts across Home → Academics →\n  Students → Finance → Home so the loop closes where it opens.\n- --scout mode screenshots candidate pages (incl. student profile tabs) to\n  direct future shots; emits marks.json + a ready ffmpeg splice command.\n\nGates: turbo typecheck pass, lint 0 errors, vitest landing suites 194/194.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3f799ec895c870e9b8bbcfc616f3130be322ce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/c3f799ec895c870e9b8bbcfc616f3130be322ce3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDQ4N2QyZTczMWNlNmZhZTgyZTkyNjRhNWVjNGMwYjZlNjlhNDNhNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/31a80d9a07041eeb764c7216e7d82e8f72b153f1","sha":"31a80d9a07041eeb764c7216e7d82e8f72b153f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/31a80d9a07041eeb764c7216e7d82e8f72b153f1"}],"sha":"487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/487d2e731ce6fae82e9264a5ec4c0b6e69a43a5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/31a80d9a07041eeb764c7216e7d82e8f72b153f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:16:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:16:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(landing): real product screen recordings for hero + District section\n\nReplace the placeholder media with real footage of the running product,\ncaptured from a synthetic-data demo tenant (no real student PII):\n\n- platform-overview.mp4 (235K, 19.5s): the Home dashboard — BS date, NPR lakh\n  fees, attendance trend, classroom table — as a seamless scroll loop in the\n  hero laptop. HeroStage autoplays it again; reduced-motion/reduced-data users\n  keep the static HeroDashboard fallback.\n- district.mp4 (540K, 15.6s): School Leaders section back to showMode=\"video\",\n  three spliced chapters (Home overview → Academics at-risk → Students roster\n  with IEMIS/Govt. Reports) with chapter starts re-timed to 0/6/11s and\n  mediaLength 0:16.\n- scripts/record-landing.mjs: the Playwright recorder that produced the clips —\n  drives the app on a fixed smooth path (content-settled waits, skeleton-aware,\n  cursor parked off the charts) and records 1600x1000 video. Re-run it against\n  a synthetic tenant to refresh footage; never point it at a real-pilot tenant.\n- Teachers & Students sections intentionally stay on their static dashboards:\n  their video story leans on deferred features (messaging/AI), and we only film\n  what''s shipped.\n\nGates: turbo typecheck 14/14, lint 0 errors, vitest landing-v2 194/194.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70bebf0fe93d999fbd283afe468078e52db385f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/70bebf0fe93d999fbd283afe468078e52db385f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/31a80d9a07041eeb764c7216e7d82e8f72b153f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/31a80d9a07041eeb764c7216e7d82e8f72b153f1","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDMxYTgwZDlh