ect the admin\n  settings regional block to the backend default* field names\n  useResolvedSettings actually reads (the old currency/calendarSystem keys\n  were silently ignored).\n- use-currency.test.tsx: lock the observed symptom — formatCompact renders\n  USD as $1.3M and NPR as NPR 12.6L (grouping is currency-driven).\n- ne/academics.json: add the missing tables.gradeLevels.presets.label key\n  (pre-existing locale-parity gap on main, surfaced by the suite).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP","tree":{"sha":"e3cf5ae1a8764199a954007e3b584971a10a2ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/e3cf5ae1a8764199a954007e3b584971a10a2ce8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/7f0d417f3017087ee7469794fb5a6f2f613499f3","verification":{"payload":"tree e3cf5ae1a8764199a954007e3b584971a10a2ce8\nparent 392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638443 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638443 +0000\n\ntest(e2e,i18n): mock /tenants/my/settings, lock currency-compact grouping, fix ne parity\n\n- e2e/fixtures/network.ts: mock GET /tenants/my/settings (non-admin shell\n  query + finance fallback need it under strictApi); correct the admin\n  settings regional block to the backend default* field names\n  useResolvedSettings actually reads (the old currency/calendarSystem keys\n  were silently ignored).\n- use-currency.test.tsx: lock the observed symptom — formatCompact renders\n  USD as $1.3M and NPR as NPR 12.6L (grouping is currency-driven).\n- ne/academics.json: add the missing tables.gradeLevels.presets.label key\n  (pre-existing locale-parity gap on main, surfaced by the suite).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLRPIl5b\n9O9VxNh6Svws1ZvfM9cr0311R8fzQsgxmJqp+Al5biCfhRSMwDveohk9+lr0v8qZvqFr8g1kfVl+\nKQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T23:07:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/7f0d417f3017087ee7469794fb5a6f2f613499f3","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDdmMGQ0MTdmMzAxNzA4N2VlNzQ2OTc5NGZiNWE2ZjJmNjEzNDk5ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10","sha":"392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10"}],"sha":"7f0d417f3017087ee7469794fb5a6f2f613499f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/7f0d417f3017087ee7469794fb5a6f2f613499f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:07:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:07:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(finance): never format KPI amounts before regional settings resolve\n\nFinanceLayout seeded SYSTEM_DEFAULTS (USD) and, when the synchronous\nschool-context payload had no settings, waited 500ms before fetching\n/tenants/my/settings — so real KPI data painted as $1.3M/$251.8K for\n~1.3s before flipping to NPR lakh.\n\n- FinanceSettingsContext now carries { settings, isReady }; useFinanceSettings()\n  is unchanged (back-compat) and a new useFinanceSettingsReady() exposes the flag.\n- Drop the artificial 500ms delay: fetch the settings fallback immediately when\n  the sync payload lacks them (a broadcast still wins if it arrives first).\n  isReady flips on broadcast OR when the fallback settles (success or failure —\n  degrade to defaults, never hang). The channel singleton fix means the sync\n  read is normally correct and no fallback runs at all.\n- Invoices + Overview KPI money values render a placeholder until isReady, so a\n  dollar amount can never paint on a PABSON tenant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP","tree":{"sha":"680ec979c49814d595167a5c0bbb08777b7a404f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/680ec979c49814d595167a5c0bbb08777b7a404f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10","verification":{"payload":"tree 680ec979c49814d595167a5c0bbb08777b7a404f\nparent 6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638433 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638433 +0000\n\nfix(finance): never format KPI amounts before regional settings resolve\n\nFinanceLayout seeded SYSTEM_DEFAULTS (USD) and, when the synchronous\nschool-context payload had no settings, waited 500ms before fetching\n/tenants/my/settings — so real KPI data painted as $1.3M/$251.8K for\n~1.3s before flipping to NPR lakh.\n\n- FinanceSettingsContext now carries { settings, isReady }; useFinanceSettings()\n  is unchanged (back-compat) and a new useFinanceSettingsReady() exposes the flag.\n- Drop the artificial 500ms delay: fetch the settings fallback immediately when\n  the sync payload lacks them (a broadcast still wins if it arrives first).\n  isReady flips on broadcast OR when the fallback settles (success or failure —\n  degrade to defaults, never hang). The channel singleton fix means the sync\n  read is normally correct and no fallback runs at all.\n- Invoices + Overview KPI money values render a placeholder until isReady, so a\n  dollar amount can never paint on a PABSON tenant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMU2FSZt\nOpkzatZ57jPH01CQXsVyuKM6gFl7cbEEDunam243AlfxyD7rOG1pQzlmtrefRxtqbasthX/AYdmu\nPQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T23:07:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDM5MjkzM2M5OGRjN2FiNWFjZmY2ZjE4NzJmYzQwYzY4OWZlOWZlMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f","sha":"6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f"}],"sha":"392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/392933c98dc7ab5acff6f1872fc40c689fe9fe10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:07:00Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:07:00Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(shell): resolve regional settings for non-admins and gate bootstrap on settings-ready\n\nCurrency/calendar/locale came only from workspaceSettings, whose query is\nTenantAdmin-only — so non-admins (parent fee portal, students) resolved\nSYSTEM_DEFAULTS (USD) permanently, and even admins could flash USD on a\ncold home load because the bootstrap gate didn''t wait for settings.\n\n- Add tenantService.getMyWorkspaceSettings() → GET /tenants/my/settings\n  (read-only, any authenticated tenant user; already registered backend +\n  API gateway, no backend change).\n- ShellProvider fetches it for non-admins and feeds the resolver, so\n  useResolvedSettings gets the real regional block for every role.\n- Fold settingsSettled (role-appropriate query success-or-error) into\n  isBootstrapping. The gate now holds one branded loader until settings\n  exist, so the shell''s settings-ful broadcast precedes every MFE mount —\n  with the channel singleton fix, remotes read correct settings at first\n  paint. Settles on error (retry:false) → no hang, ~0 added latency.\n- clearSchoolContext() also blanks the channel payload on logout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP","tree":{"sha":"c227b52329a8ebbf3c9b08e69dc2213c5886ad13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/c227b52329a8ebbf3c9b08e69dc2213c5886ad13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f","verification":{"payload":"tree c227b52329a8ebbf3c9b08e69dc2213c5886ad13\nparent 9946de6018704048d86b7615e2fd6706bc91b4f0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638420 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638420 +0000\n\nfix(shell): resolve regional settings for non-admins and gate bootstrap on settings-ready\n\nCurrency/calendar/locale came only from workspaceSettings, whose query is\nTenantAdmin-only — so non-admins (parent fee portal, students) resolved\nSYSTEM_DEFAULTS (USD) permanently, and even admins could flash USD on a\ncold home load because the bootstrap gate didn''t wait for settings.\n\n- Add tenantService.getMyWorkspaceSettings() → GET /tenants/my/settings\n  (read-only, any authenticated tenant user; already registered backend +\n  API gateway, no backend change).\n- ShellProvider fetches it for non-admins and feeds the resolver, so\n  useResolvedSettings gets the real regional block for every role.\n- Fold settingsSettled (role-appropriate query success-or-error) into\n  isBootstrapping. The gate now holds one branded loader until settings\n  exist, so the shell''s settings-ful broadcast precedes every MFE mount —\n  with the channel singleton fix, remotes read correct settings at first\n  paint. Settles on error (retry:false) → no hang, ~0 added latency.\n- clearSchoolContext() also blanks the channel payload on logout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOo1Z7+d\n0NaLXsOnJ7ZBDNtoraIjODyP0C+7NSzqjx11lrpFc6SpjTe85L9kDXXGawT71kL7gq4wFhz+UTV6\ngwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T23:07:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDZmMmUyZjlmY2I4ZWM4ODRhZjUzNTUwOWIzZTEzYTk3Njg0OWM0NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/9946de6018704048d86b7615e2fd6706bc91b4f0","sha":"9946de6018704048d86b7615e2fd6706bc91b4f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/9946de6018704048d86b7615e2fd6706bc91b4f0"}],"sha":"6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/6f2e2f9fcb8ec884af535509b3e13a976849c45f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/9946de6018704048d86b7615e2fd6706bc91b4f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:06:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:06:46Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(config): share the school-context channel as a real cross-container singleton\n\nThe MF shared map keyed on the bare specifier ''@edforge/config'', but the\npackage exports only subpaths (no \".\" entry) and every consumer imports\n''@edforge/config/school-context-channel''. A bare share key matches only the\nexact request string, so it never engaged — each remote silently bundled its\nown copy of the channel with its own module-scope _lastPayload. The shell''s\nbroadcastSchoolChange(...resolvedSettings) reached only the shell''s copy;\nthe finance MFE''s synchronous getSchoolContext() at mount read an empty\nlocal copy and seeded SYSTEM_DEFAULTS (USD), producing the ~1.3s USD→NPR\ncurrency flash on PABSON tenants (and the older archetype US-shape bug the\nSprint A.12 comment claimed to fix — it never actually did).\n\n- Replace the no-op bare key with the trailing-slash prefix share\n  ''@edforge/config/'' (matches all subpath requests; requiredVersion is\n  not meaningful for prefix shares). Build manifests now list\n  school-context-channel + resolved-settings as shared in all four\n  containers.\n- broadcastSchoolChange now merges over the retained _lastPayload instead\n  of replacing it: schoolId/schoolStatus always take the new values, but\n  omitted optional fields (resolvedSettings/tenantId/archetype/country)\n  are preserved. This stops the store''s schoolId-only broadcasts\n  (setActiveSchoolId/setActiveSchoolStatus) from blanking the settings a\n  late-mounting MFE reads synchronously.\n- Add resetSchoolContext() for logout hygiene (the Amplify signedOut path\n  does not reload) and test isolation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP","tree":{"sha":"1e9e0d997270630da2265c39544766dd3b3c2960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/1e9e0d997270630da2265c39544766dd3b3c2960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/9946de6018704048d86b7615e2fd6706bc91b4f0","verification":{"payload":"tree 1e9e0d997270630da2265c39544766dd3b3c2960\nparent 33cf59c07007b9b544bebcbf6a0a7e91476b1494\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638406 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783638406 +0000\n\nfix(config): share the school-context channel as a real cross-container singleton\n\nThe MF shared map keyed on the bare specifier ''@edforge/config'', but the\npackage exports only subpaths (no \".\" entry) and every consumer imports\n''@edforge/config/school-context-channel''. A bare share key matches only the\nexact request string, so it never engaged — each remote silently bundled its\nown copy of the channel with its own module-scope _lastPayload. The shell''s\nbroadcastSchoolChange(...resolvedSettings) reached only the shell''s copy;\nthe finance MFE''s synchronous getSchoolContext() at mount read an empty\nlocal copy and seeded SYSTEM_DEFAULTS (USD), producing the ~1.3s USD→NPR\ncurrency flash on PABSON tenants (and the older archetype US-shape bug the\nSprint A.12 comment claimed to fix — it never actually did).\n\n- Replace the no-op bare key with the trailing-slash prefix share\n  ''@edforge/config/'' (matches all subpath requests; requiredVersion is\n  not meaningful for prefix shares). Build manifests now list\n  school-context-channel + resolved-settings as shared in all four\n  containers.\n- broadcastSchoolChange now merges over the retained _lastPayload instead\n  of replacing it: schoolId/schoolStatus always take the new values, but\n  omitted optional fields (resolvedSettings/tenantId/archetype/country)\n  are preserved. This stops the store''s schoolId-only broadcasts\n  (setActiveSchoolId/setActiveSchoolStatus) from blanking the settings a\n  late-mounting MFE reads synchronously.\n- Add resetSchoolContext() for logout hygiene (the Amplify signedOut path\n  does not reload) and test isolation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012qd2yDDSMyjMxRtcPq6oRP\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDp3TVUf\nJnI0fF9GAd3RSwGDTS2cYzhAiT0QzIuWdGZkQMteGQL/d9ph4RmseeGaDEJTXg5yy0odPxUZDcUa\ndgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-09T23:07:35Z"}},"commi