"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/772d84b8c49b64940e106af43cb9d33f4e150b96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:21:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T15:21:29Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"chore(landing): soften stage-inflated claims for honesty\n\nAlign landing copy with the product''s actual Year-1 stage (per the internal\nroadmap) so the page reads honestly for evaluators, without losing context:\n\n- Security: drop the \"SOC 2\" and \"ISO 27001\" badges (SOC 2 is a later goal; ISO\n  27001 isn''t on the roadmap). Keep FERPA, COPPA, GDPR, SSDPC.\n- Platform & API card: no longer claims shipped GraphQL / public API / SSO /\n  webhooks; reframes around the open Ed-Fi data model + data export, with public\n  API / GraphQL / SSO called out as roadmap.\n- FAQ: Google Workspace / Microsoft 365 SSO + calendar/assignment sync moved\n  from \"Yes, natively\" to near-term roadmap.\n- District dashboard sample numbers reduced from 45,231 students / 12 schools to\n  4,120 / 4 schools so the mock doesn''t imply traction the pilot doesn''t have.\n\nTest assertions updated in lockstep. Copy-catalog tests read dynamically from\nthe strings catalog, so no changes were needed there.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aebc952caf62a18ccf6d89b24bef2e4f8a0