t showMode=\"dashboard\" so\n  the District/Teacher/Student product dashboards render instead of the demo\n  video; the feature rail still works.\n- Video machinery (DemoVideo, LaptopFrame video path, LANDING_VIDEOS config,\n  chapter data) kept intact and dormant. Restore video by flipping showMode back\n  to \"video\" / staticFallback to the reduced-motion computation.\n- Stock MP4s left in place as the swap-in target for a later real-video pass.\n\nGates: turbo typecheck 30/30, turbo lint 0 errors, vitest landing-v2 194/194.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"acc9cdcad8c3b09c002b6f17708f99edd4bc2664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/acc9cdcad8c3b09c002b6f17708f99edd4bc2664"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/943b608ffc76697d252f5680a7d6afcb4e2c7852","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github