s not a function)\n\nGET /users/:id/security/sessions returns SecuritySessionsListDto\n({ sessions, total, currentSessionId }), not a bare array. The service typed it\nas UserSession[] and returned the wrapper, so the Sessions tab ran\n`sessions.some(...)` on an object and crashed the whole page.\n\n- getActiveSessions now unwraps res.sessions (guarded to [] on any other shape).\n- security.tsx normalizes to sessionList = Array.isArray(sessions) ? sessions : []\n  so a future shape drift degrades to the empty state instead of a hard crash.\n- Tests mock the wrapped apiGet response (would have caught this) + the\n  missing-field fallback. 9 pass, typecheck clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b4d29a4eba378b6f3c226d5a4513176f2f2d7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/0b4d29a4eba378b6f3c226d5a4513176f2f2d7f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/8b0817d8b2319ccaa9520c61cb359da9fce68153","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/8b0817d8b2319ccaa9520c61cb359da9fce68153","node_id":"C_kwDOQov0ktoAKDhiMDgxN2Q4YjIzMTljY2FhOTUyMGM2MWNiMzU5ZGE5ZmNlNjgxNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commit/ee2482652edde15cd5d7e5517173475f6d31261e","sha":"ee2482652edde15cd5d7e5517173475f6d31261e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/ee2482652edde15cd5d7e5517173475f6d31261e"}],"sha":"8b0817d8b2319ccaa9520c61cb359da9fce68153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/8b0817d8b2319ccaa9520c61cb359da9fce68153"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/ee2482652edde15cd5d7e5517173475f6d31261e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:26:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:26:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(shell): session management UI — register/heartbeat + sessions tab (SR.1-4 FE)\n\nWires the deployed sessions-v1 backend (SR.1-SR.4) into the shell.\n\nSlice 1 — session lifecycle:\n- registerSession (SR.1) + touchSession (SR.3) service methods.\n- useSessionLifecycle hook: registers the caller''s session after sign-in and\n  runs a 5-min heartbeat that rebinds the row to the current access token after\n  a silent Cognito refresh. Mounted in ProtectedLayout. Best-effort — never\n  blocks the app; a revoked/expired session surfaces via the api client''s 401\n  interceptor.\n- revokeAllSessions gains the exceptCurrent QUERY param (was posting {} with a\n  misleading ''except current'' comment; the backend reads @Query(''exceptCurrent'')).\n\nSlice 2 — Settings > Security ''Sessions'' tab:\n- New tab lists active sessions (reusing the built SessionCard), current-session\n  badge (server-computed isCurrent), per-session revoke, and ''sign out other\n  devices'' (revokeAllSessions exceptCurrent=true). Loading/empty/error states.\n- i18n keys added to en + ne settings.\n\nTests: route-shape guards pin the register/touch/revoke-all URLs against the\ndeployed routes; component test covers list/sign-out-others/empty. 7 pass,\ntypecheck clean, 0 lint errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d065c59a6a929b4e99577deaa97dd30ad42b6305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/d065c59a6a929b4e99577deaa97dd30ad42b6305"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/ee2482652edde15cd5d7e5517173475f6d31261e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_us