ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/commits/53fde0bdcf834980b1faedd8f10088eb49e33994/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T19:06:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T19:06:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test(academics): computeTargetIntersection unit tests (#254)\n\nCovers the exam bulk-status target intersection: empty input, same\nsingle-/multi-action status, canonical pipeline ordering, mixed statuses\nsharing one reachable target, disjoint statuses → empty, terminal-status\ncollapse, and action-metadata preservation. The #254 i18n retrofit (part 1)\nalready landed in a prior PR — every drawer string routes through\nexamModule.bulkDrawer.* keys (en+ne present) — so this closes the remaining\npart 2. No source changes; the helper is already exported.\n\nCloses #254\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018qn84YpBqTwUBHrGdgK8xY","tree":{"sha":"52bb5ba5d74f62a6498b412b182bc58ce96e7733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/trees/52bb5ba5d74f62a6498b412b182bc58ce96e7733"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoaibrain/edforge-saas-frontend/git/commits/53fde0bdcf834980b1faedd8f10088eb49e33994","verification":{"payload":"tree 52bb5ba5d74f62a6498b412b182bc58ce96e7733\nparent 0ba804411a17a72fb7360d8293ded199b0732a76\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783278390 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783278390 +0000\n\ntest(academics): computeTargetIntersection unit tests (#254)\n\nCovers the exam bulk-status target intersection: empty input, same\nsingle-/multi-action status, canonical pipeline ordering, mixed statuses\nsharing one reachable target, disjoint statuses → empty, terminal-status\ncollapse, and action-metadata preservation. The #254 i18n retrofit (part 1)\nalready landed in a prior PR