},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/d95c9465752c6aeeb7d788044040679d093b9cfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T21:17:34Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T21:17:34Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Seed Scenario A social lane; add it to the party gallery\n\nThe party deployment''s `/social/feed` was empty — the one surface most central\nto \"a post is not a vote\", and the most visibly social one, showing nothing.\n\n- Add `journeySocial` to scripts/party-journeys.js (A2.7/A2.14): 10 attributed\n  Italian updates from the cast, 6 typed follow edges (circle/interest/info/\n  alerts), and a reshare-with-commentary. The feed is follower-scoped, so it\n  drives and screenshots Anna''s populated wall.\n- Add the `party-social` screenshot as a highlight row in the README party\n  gallery: at a glance a social post carries no quorum/stance/tally, so the\n  small-talk lane reads as separate from the formal decision track.\n- Regenerated the party gallery (11 shots). Logged the remaining A2.13 gap\n  (a locked photo with a view request) in OPTIMIZATIONS.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"879892c7705d27f26c635eb9e12402685cf11dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/879892c7705d27f26c635eb9e12402685cf11dc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/d95c9465752c6aeeb7d788044040679d093b9cfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/d95c9465752c6aeeb7d788044040679d093b9cfd","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGQ5NWM5NDY1NzUyYzZhZWViN2Q3ODgwNDQwNDA2NzlkMDkzYjljZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/73d417aa5a8a03e03c4de12f2c6b71beea0cb17d","sha":"73d417aa5a8a03e03c4de12f2c6b71beea0cb17d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/73d417aa5a8a03e03c4de12f2c6b71beea0cb17d"}],"sha":"d95c9465752c6aeeb7d788044040679d093b9cfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/d95c9465752c6aeeb7d788044040679d093b9cfd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/73d417aa5a8a03e03c4de12f2c6b71beea0cb17d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T21:03:10Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T21:03:10Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"UI: feed identity for proposals, compact README screenshot tables\n\nExtend the content-first feed treatment to the civic proposal surfaces and\ntighten how the walkthroughs present.\n\nProposal & deliberation cards (petitionView.js):\n- Lead with the feed head — avatar + @handle byline + timestamp + prominent\n  title — instead of burying the title under ~14 pills.\n- Keep only the state a reader acts on in the meta row (coloured stage, quorum,\n  signatures, frozen, topic); collapse secondary counts (updated-by, revisions,\n  discussion, arguments, last comment, permalink) into one quiet sub-line.\n- Give proposal deliberation comments and the cross-proposal \"Active\n  deliberations\" feed the same avatar + byline + coloured stance chip, dropping\n  the old \"Author: …\" / \"Comment by …\" footer lines. Stage pills are colour-keyed\n  (discussion/vote/closed).\n\nREADME:\n- Replace the two full-width, one-image-per-step walkthroughs with compact\n  2-column caption tables so the galleries no longer eat a screen each; the\n  framing intros, run commands, and closing notes are kept.\n- Regenerated md-assets/party and md-assets/walkthrough against the final UI.\n\nFull suite: 203 tests, 200 pass, 3 skipped (MySQL env), 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4469cbcfe9d40e36adc693a01826790c300fb121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/4469cbcfe9d40e36adc693a01826790c300fb121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/73d417aa5a8a03e03c4de12f2c6b71beea0cb17d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscripti