ogin":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/29f3acccb6e5b3dd408d9b4d36b5c90f8d0a8a3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:14:22Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:14:22Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Add SSR pagination to discussion and petitions lists\n\nLong lists previously rendered in full. New shared paginate()/renderPager()\nhelpers add page-size-20 SSR pagination with query-preserving prev/next\ncontrols (respecting the topic/stage filters and partial navigation) to the\ndiscussion and petitions lists. Out-of-range pages clamp to the last page;\nthe pager hides when there is only one page.\n\nTests: tests/pagination.test.js (paginate windowing/clamping, parsePage,\nrenderPager query preservation + single-page hiding, and an HTTP check that\nthe discussion list splits across two pages). Full suite green: 161 non-UI\n+ 18 UI. Forum and social feed remain to be wired with the same helpers\n(noted in ROADMAP/OPTIMIZATIONS).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"390deb92cba018bacf83265903a8c038b0b227d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/390deb92cba018bacf83265903a8c038b0b227d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/29f3acccb6e5b3dd408d9b4d36b5c90f8d0a8a3d","verification":{"payload":null,"rea