tps://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/0324f223a3dd5a2e3778a27dabcabcac2a6bf5d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:54:35Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:54:35Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Make identity legible and discoverable (real-life-readiness pass)\n\nUI audit found the demo feel was rooted in identity: raw pid hashes shown\nas identity everywhere, no way to set a human handle, and no way to\ndiscover people (delegate/follow forms required typing a raw hash). This\naddresses the P0 cluster.\n\n- Handles: members set a validated, unique handle on /profile\n  (validateHandleChoice enforces charset/length, blocks reserved\n  synthesized patterns, checks uniqueness); handle_set is logged.\n- Shared resolver: resolveHandleForHash + renderActorLabel render\n  @handle with a short hash cue (full hash in title), synthesizing the\n  same role-hash8 fallback getPerson() uses when no handle is chosen.\n  Wired into delegation chain/list/suggestions, delegate profiles,\n  petitions (author + comments), discussion, forum, social feed, and the\n  home audit lane via the shared renderAuthorHashLine helper.\n- Discovery: new browsable People directory at GET /delegates (handle/\n  role/delegation counts + search) plus nav entry; handle-datalist\n  pickers on the delegation and follow forms replace free-text hash\n  entry, and delegation resolves a typed handle/hash to a known verified\n  person (404 with guidance otherwise).\n\nTests: tests/identity-handles.test.js (resolver, handle validation/\nuniqueness, directory ranking/search) and tests/identity-directory.test.js\n(HTTP: handle set, directory, delegation-by-handle, uniqueness/validation,\nunknown-delegate rejection). Full suite green: 154 non-UI + 18 UI + 2\nexternal adapters. Remaining raw-hash spots and a resolver memo noted in\nOPTIMIZATIONS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2b69e66d98f4163a584d9f3dddef393962206d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/b2b69e66d98f4163a584d9f3dddef393962206d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/0324f223a3dd5a2e3778a27dabcabcac2a6bf5d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/0324f223a3dd5a2e3778a27dabcabcac2a6bf5d6","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKDAzMjRmMjIzYTNkZDVhMmUzNzc4YTI3ZGFiY2FiY2FjMmE2YmY1ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22","sha":"0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22"}],"sha":"0324f223a3dd5a2e3778a27dabcabcac2a6bf5d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/0324f223a3dd5a2e3778a27dabcabcac2a6bf5d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:22:25Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:22:25Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Add delegation decay/renewal cycles with admin-configurable window\n\nIntroduces a delegationDecayDays governance setting (0 = off, editable in\n/admin, published at /governance). When enabled, un-renewed delegations\nolder than the window lapse and drop out of resolveDelegation (first hop\nand transitive hops alike), so liquid voting power does not persist\nunattended.\n\nsetDelegation now stamps renewedAt; new renewDelegation refreshes it\n(intent=renew on /delegation, logged as delegation_renew). The delegation\nlist shows freshness pills (active/expiring/lapsed) with a per-topic Renew\naction and a decay-window note. describeDelegationFreshness/\ngetDelegationDecayDays expose the classification.\n\nNew tests/delegation-decay.test.js covers decay on/off, lapsed-hop chain\ntruncation, renewal, freshness classification, and setting clamping.\nUpdated ROADMAP/AGENTS and logged a memoization follow-up in OPTIMIZATIONS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9603a754851f95d899da0353179786e2ae743e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/e9603a754851f95d899da0353179786e2ae743e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKDBjMDllNjIxYjE4MjgwMzIzYzhkOTA1NDBlNjBiYjUxMzg3YmZlMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/e2fea7902da5a8ffb763afbf2ae40e3b6588045a","sha":"e2fea7902da5a8ffb763afbf2ae40e3b6588045a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/e2fea7902da5a8ffb763afbf2ae40e3b6588045a"}],"sha":"0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/0c09e621b18280323c8d90540e60bb51387bfe22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/e2fea7902da5a8ffb763afbf2ae40e3b6588045a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:16:40Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:16:40Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Implement liquid (transitive) delegation, chain visualization, and deliberation score\n\nresolveDelegation now follows a delegate''s own per-topic choices to the\nterminal delegate (liquid democracy), with cycle detection, a depth cap\n(MAX_DELEGATION_CHAIN_DEPTH), and a stop before forwarding into a banned\ndelegate. Group/extension recommendations resolve only the first hop and\nstay advisory; petition auto-votes resolve through the terminal delegate.\n\nAdded buildDelegationChain for an \"explain my influence\" chain view on\n/delegation, and an advisory, capped deliberation score (trust /\nparticipation / deliberation / endorsement x recency, with a rising-star\ncue) surfaced on delegate profiles.\n\nNew tests/delegation-transitive.test.js covers transitive resolution,\ncycle/depth/banned guards, topic scoping, path dedup, and the score.\nUpdated ROADMAP/AGENTS and logged follow-up caching ideas in OPTIMIZATIONS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f14d0a5d2f842645b2f86c6df127e928b2ff2ad2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/f14d0a5d2f842645b2f86c6df127e928b2ff2ad2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/e2fea7902da5a8ffb763afbf2ae40e3b6588045a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gra