emplates.js).\n- Updated roadmap/docs/agent guidance and optimizations (including libp2p follow-up direction) in:\n  - [ROADMAP.md](/Users/riccardo/Sources/Codeberg/party-web/ROADMAP.md)\n  - [README.md](/Users/riccardo/Sources/Codeberg/party-web/README.md)\n  - [AGENTS.md](/Users/riccardo/Sources/Codeberg/party-web/AGENTS.md)\n  - [OPTIMIZATIONS.md](/Users/riccardo/Sources/Codeberg/party-web/OPTIMIZATIONS.md)\n- Added/updated tests for the new lane metadata and onboarding copy in [modules.test.js](/Users/riccardo/Sources/Codeberg/party-web/tests/modules.test.js) and [ui.test.js](/Users/riccardo/Sources/Codeberg/party-web/tests/ui.test.js).\n\nValidation:\n- Ran `npm test` successfully: 148 pass, 0 fail, 2 skipped (MySQL-related skips due unavailable local MySQL).","tree":{"sha":"a54f293c1a2efb4b233784f7db25c906b85c82e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/a54f293c1a2efb4b233784f7db25c906b85c82e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/1d2dd4c97a48e3de1bcd868422de875dcc6f81a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscript