 roadmap slice focused on practical day-to-day use, plus realtime Puppeteer verification.\n\nWhat changed\n\nAdded a persistent top-bar Interface settings panel (large text, reduced motion, compact nav, composer auto-collapse preference, partial-navigation mode) in topbar.html.\nAdded side-nav jump filtering UI in shell.html.\nImplemented client-side dynamic settings lifecycle (local persistence, body data flags, runtime application) in app.js and app.js.\nAdded keyboard-driven nav filtering (Ctrl/Cmd+K, /, Esc) in app.js.\nAdded optional full-page navigation mode (disable partial interception when desired) in app.js and app.js.\nAdded practical UX feedback: busy indicator + toasts in app.js and app.js.\nMade sticky composer auto-collapse respect user setting in app.js.\nAdded styling for all of the above in app.css, app.css, and app.css.\nNew Puppeteer realtime UI test\n\nAdded end-to-end UI test for settings + practical navigation behavior in ui.test.js.\nMarkdown updates\n\nSynced docs and roadmap status in:\nREADME.md\nROADMAP.md\nAGENTS.md\nOPTIMIZATIONS.md\nTests run\n\nui.test.js -> pass\nui.test.js -> pass (15/15)\nnpm test -> pass (145 passed, 0 failed, 1 skipped: MySQL adapter unavailable)","tree":{"sha":"1aa9a1f4001cf6aad613aa174b14aa6603690e41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/1aa9a1f4001cf6aad613aa174b14aa6603690e41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/393d4970b34d4e520339d8fc2dbf6b603739765f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u