?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/d7d88374ad2502c97af9d18249297bcbbed072ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T12:36:02Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T12:36:02Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added a hierarchy tree inside the Composer panel and made the Composer tools draggable/collapsible with persistent UI position in localStorage. Also documented the remaining gaps (floating contextual inspector + persistent DOM mutation storage + module template relocation) in the roadmap and synced AGENTS/optimizations.\n\nDetails:\n\nAdded drag handle + collapse control and a hierarchy section to the Composer UI in templates.js.\nImplemented hierarchy tree build/selection sync and panel drag/collapse state persistence in app.js.\nStyled the hierarchy tree and draggable/collapsible panel states in app.css.\nRoadmapped the unimplemented items (contextual inspector, persistent DOM mutations, module-template reorg) in ROADMAP.md and synced AGENTS.md.\nLogged a composer tree refresh optimization in OPTIMIZATIONS.md.\nTests:\n\napp.js\nNotes on your points:\n\nDOM tree: now available for all [data-composer-key] elements, with nested structure and click-to-select.\nFloating inspector: current panel is movable/collapsible; the contextual floating inspector remains a roadmap item.\nPersistence: layout + CSS overrides already persist via “Save composer changes”; full DOM mutation persistence is now explicitly in the roadmap.\nTemplate reorg: added as a roadmap item (module-local templates + subcomponents).","tree":{"sha":"1f1d23242eb84cf9f6d66f4290766a37be30cd20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/1f1d23242eb84cf9f6d66f4290766a37be30cd20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/d7d88374ad2502c97af9d18249297bcbbed072ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/d7d88374ad2502c97af9d18249297bcbbed072ce","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGQ3ZDg4Mzc0YWQy