s the same behavior, just later in evaluation order.\n\nDetails:\n\napp.js now defines the startup IIFE after all composer helpers/state.","tree":{"sha":"d780f7d105b6a02b60979e5d28e85e151f172d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/d780f7d105b6a02b60979e5d28e85e151f172d4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/eed136120f374d289752e4e8cd0308435a80dc33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/eed136120f374d289752e4e8cd0308435a80dc33","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGVlZDEzNjEyMGYzNzRkMjg5NzUyZTRlOGNkMDMwODQzNWE4MGRjMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe","sha":"c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe"}],"sha":"eed136120f374d289752e4e8cd0308435a80dc33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/eed136120f374d289752e4e8cd0308435a80dc33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T02:15:03Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T02:15:03Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Composer mode now gates off the body’s allow flag, auto-tags panel headings/eyebrows for selection/editing, and applies text overrides client‑side so panel/module labels persist without extra template wiring. I also wired the composer lists to act like a simple layer picker (click to select) and highlight the active item so panel-level selection is more obvious.\n\nDetails:\n\napp.js now hydrates panel text targets with deterministic keys/defaults, applies text overrides on load/refresh, and hides the tool when data-composer-allowed isn’t true.\napp.js list items in the nav/layout sections select their corresponding DOM nodes and keep selection state in sync with the inspector.\napp.css adds a selected state style for list items to make the “panel layers” view clearer.","tree":{"sha":"75abd87edb7cadfc50c985f0c1d811941c035e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/75abd87edb7cadfc50c985f0c1d811941c035e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGMzMTg3OGRjNjEyNDM5NTVjYTQ3YTExNjBjZWMzNzJjNDg5MzJlYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e","sha":"c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e"}],"sha":"c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c31878dc61243955ca47a1160cec372c48932ebe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T01:24:22Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T01:24:22Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Composer mode now mirrors the GrapesJS-style flow from your sample: the button toggles an on-page edit state, clicks select elements with a live overlay, double-click enables inline text edits, and the tool is hidden when disallowed.\n\napp.js: added edit-mode selection/overlay behavior, double‑click inline editing, toggle label sync, and stricter click gating while composer mode is on.\napp.css: updated edit-mode hover/selection styles and added overlay visuals to match the sample’s affordances.\ntemplates.js: set the default button copy to “Enter Composer” and kept tool markup in sync.\nOPTIMIZATIONS.md: noted an observer-based overlay update optimization.","tree":{"sha":"3d2c567e12029c90e9e40a7bfa2921f3d9cd62df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/3d2c567e12029c90e9e40a7bfa2921f3d9cd62df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGM1ZmEzNmZlMTM0MzgxN2IzNTY5NWMzMDY0ZmYyYzQxOTAyZGVkNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/c1063b4c8d9dfabeb9ef35f437606782fcd51e38","sha":"c1063b4c8d9dfabeb9ef35f437606782fcd51e38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c1063b4c8d9dfabeb9ef35f437606782fcd51e38"}],"sha":"c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c5fa36fe1343817b35695c3064ff2c41902ded4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/c1063b4c8d9dfabeb9ef35f437606782fcd51e38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T01:07:18Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T01:07:18Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Composer mode now initializes reliably by trusting the composer tool itself and keeping the allowed flag in sync during partial navigations, so the button actually flips the page into edit mode like the example. I also added a tool-level allow marker so the JS can bootstrap even if the body flag drifts.\n\napp.js hides the tool when not allowed, forces mode off, and rebinds when the tool node changes; it now accepts data-composer-allowed=\"true\" from the tool as a fallback.\ntemplates.js stamps data-composer-allowed=\"true\" onto the composer tool markup and always emits data-composer-allowed in the page meta so partial updates keep the body flag 