"email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-18T22:40:14Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Reworked the social and forum layouts into a two‑column grid so long feeds don’t hide controls, moved wall filters into a side rail, and added an explicit expand/collapse toggle for the social composer (with JS + CSS) so it’s easy to open/close. Also reordered child nav items to surface primary actions first and updated the optimization note to include forum feed pagination.\n\nDetails:\n\nsocial.html now uses a page-grid with a main wall feed and a side rail for compose + wall controls + follows.\nforum.html now uses a page-grid with threads in the main column and compose in a side rail.\napp.css adds page-grid/page-aside layout, removes nested wall scroll, and styles the composer toggle + collapsible section.\napp.js adds a data-compose-toggle handler to expand/collapse the social composer.\nsocial.js now supplies composeState/toggle label/ARIA state.\nnavigation.js reorders child menu items (actions first).\nOPTIMIZATIONS.md now includes forum in the feed pagination/perf note.","tree":{"sha":"cbe4c6ea206df422d50ac2883fbacb75b94efd92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/cbe4c6ea206df422d50ac2883fbacb75b94efd92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/4e9db89e9e24773238ba695fccaf01a6a0faabd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr"