":"2026-01-16T03:04:53Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Extended forum comments with evidence prompts and persistence, and persisted the ActivityPub object/activity id index so duplicate checks can reuse stored snapshots on restart.\n\nDetails\n\nAdded evidence link inputs + rendering for forum comments, wired to parsing and transaction logging. (forum.js, forumView.js, text.js, shared.js)\nPersisted ActivityPub index snapshots and load-time refresh to avoid rebuilding from posts after restart, plus adapter/storage support and file path wiring. (posts.js, storage.js, json.js, kv.js, sql.js, mysql.js, mongodb.js, memory.js, config.js)\nAdded a forum evidence link test and updated docs/optimizations to match. (forum-evidence.test.js, README.md, ROADMAP.md, AGENTS.md, OPTIMIZATIONS.md)\nTests\n\nnpm test","tree":{"sha":"c756bc944c2d302d027da34cb901ae9b20ff201a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/c756bc944c2d302d027da34cb901ae9b20ff201a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/8cd330993efb7d20302220607a213557bdc98ca5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/o