er":{"date":"2026-01-16T02:45:15Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added discussion‑level evidence/citation support and ActivityPub duplicate indexing to advance roadmap items across UX and P2P/data paths, with shared parsing/rendering to keep behavior consistent. Updated docs/optimization notes to match the new capabilities.\n\nDetails\n\nDiscussion posts now accept optional evidence links, display evidence pills/lists, and log evidence counts for audits. (discussion.html, discussion.js, discussionView.js)\nEvidence link parsing/rendering is shared across discussions and petitions to avoid duplication and keep output consistent. (text.js, shared.js, petitionView.js, petitions.js)\nActivityPub duplicate detection uses a cached object/activity id index instead of scanning all posts each time. (posts.js, activitypub.js)\nRoadmap/docs + optimization log updated to reflect these changes. (README.md, ROADMAP.md, AGENTS.md, OPTIMIZATIONS.md)\nTests\n\nnpm test","tree":{"sha":"d60a515319ab1e2cdf00df91d384a99700f0bf2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/d60a515319ab1e2cdf00df91d384a99700f0bf2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/dba9d8d1f184b93fce11c41ac46b013af71b7696","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/dba9d8d1f184b93fce11c41ac46b013af71b7696","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGRiYTlkOGQxZjE4NGI5M2ZjZTExYzQxYWM0NmIwMTNhZjcxYjc2OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0","sha":"7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0"}],"sha":"dba9d8d1f184b93fce11c41ac46b013af71b7696","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/dba9d8d1f184b93fce11c41ac46b013af71b7696"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-16T02:37:05Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-16T02:37:05Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Consolidated preview/byte formatting helpers for consistent UX and less duplication, and reduced petition comment summary passes to a single scan. Logged new optimization ideas and completed items.\n\nDetails\n\nAdded a shared preview-pill renderer and replaced inline preview markup across UI surfaces for consistent labeling. (shared.js, discussionView.js, forumView.js, socialView.js, petitionView.js, admin.js, delegation.js, groups.js)\nCentralized formatBytes() and reused it in social/admin media rendering to remove duplicate logic. (text.js, socialView.js, admin.js)\nCollapsed petition comment argument/last-activity scans into one summary pass to cut redundant loops. (petitionView.js)\nUpdated optimization backlog with nav caching + libp2p evaluation ideas and marked completed items. (OPTIMIZATIONS.md)","tree":{"sha":"1d81f423ac1957eff0b80efbb49f4266a6ec383a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/1d81f423ac1957eff0b80efbb49f4266a6ec383a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKDdjNjgzMjJlZmQ4MDVkMzAxZmQ4Y2M3NjhhOTQ4ODg3MDA0ZjlhZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/820d9688d0de037296ea6f585027d0665ac636da","sha":"820d9688d0de037296ea6f585027d0665ac636da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/820d9688d0de037296ea6f585027d0665ac636da"}],"sha":"7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/7c68322efd805d301fd8cc768a948887004f9af0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/820d9688d0de037296ea6f585027d0665ac636da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-14T16:33:21Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-14T16:33:21Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added indexed lookups for social posts/media to cut linear scans, and centralized the “Author hash” line so discussion/forum/petition/social views render it consistently.\n\nSocial lookup speedups: media.js adds an on-demand media index; posts.js adds a post index plus invalidation, with social.js and activitypub.js invalidating when they append posts; social feed media lookup now uses indexed lookups in social.js.\nUX consistency: shared.js now exposes renderAuthorHashLine, and it replaces repeated markup in discussionView.js, forumView.js, petitionView.js, and socialView.js.\nFuture optimizations captured: added ActivityPub duplicate-detection indexing idea in OPTIMIZATIONS.md.","tree":{"sha":"115fcbe0cda40c5cb51f7beec5c11399caf6e7fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/115fcbe0cda40c5cb51f7beec5c11399caf6e7fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/820d9688d0de037296ea6f585027d0665ac636da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.