ame":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added an admin‑side key generator that saves signing keys into settings and loads them into memory immediately, plus startup hydration so stored keys are picked up when env vars aren’t set. The admin page now includes a confirmation‑gated “Generate signing keys” action, and docs/roadmap reflect the capability.\n\nNew helper module: signingKeys.js (keygen + resolve/apply + fingerprint)\nStartup hydration: storage.js loads stored keys into env if needed\nAdmin flow + UI: admin.js, admin.html\nDocs updates: README.md, ROADMAP.md\nNotes:\n\nAdmin‑generated keys are saved in settings.json, but CIRCLE_PRIVATE_KEY / CIRCLE_PUBLIC_KEY env vars still override on restart.","tree":{"sha":"4d21b6486e7b7c7fab5ffc0a772dbb41908adadc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/4d21b6486e7b7c7fab5ffc0a772dbb41908adadc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/dcd438107a0b885d1592576ca250a790c1b50a48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/dcd438107a0b885d1592576ca250a790c1b50a48","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKGRjZDQzODEwN2EwYjg4NWQxNTkyNTc2Y2EyNTBhNzkwYzFiNTBhNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543","sha":"6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543"}],"sha":"dcd438107a0b885d1592576ca250a790c1b50a48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/dcd438107a0b885d1592576ca250a790c1b50a48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-09T17:00:28Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-09T17:00:28Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added request‑body safety limits and a keygen helper, plus admin UX improvements for signing keys and provider‑blind ring key input; docs and env examples now reflect the new knobs and correct key handling.\n\nRequest body caps + multipart rejection (with 413/415 mapping and +json parsing) wired through request.js, server.js, and config.js, with env defaults in .env.example.\nAdmin callout + ring key PEM block parsing/formatting and hinting in admin.js and admin.html, plus more robust multipart detection in social.js.\nOptional libp2p‑backed key generator shipped as circle-keygen.js with an npm hook in package.json.\nDocs synced in README.md, ROADMAP.md, and OPTIMIZATIONS.md (including corrected CIRCLE_* examples and the new request‑body knobs).","tree":{"sha":"642fa49df9c0aee50c2c747a5d393bfe8faab652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/642fa49df9c0aee50c2c747a5d393bfe8faab652"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKDZkOTE5YmU4MDIzZDIwYjhmZGU3NjFiZDBkYTRkM2M5NDUyODA1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52","sha":"15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52"}],"sha":"6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/6d919be8023d20b8fde761bd0da4d3c945280543"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-08T16:41:39Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-08T16:41:39Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added upload cleanup tracking so temp file pruning reports show up in /admin and /health, plus gossip run durations for better P2P ops visibility, and tightened the cleanup stats to count only .upload files. Docs now reflect the new ops cues and audit visibility.\n\nserver.js: record cleanup runs/errors/skips in state.uploadCleanup and avoid scheduling when retention is disabled.\nhealth.js: expose upload cleanup details and gossip durations in /health.\nadmin.js and admin.html: add the Upload cleanup panel and show gossip run durations.\ngossip.js: include durationMs in gossip summaries.\nrequest.js: fix cleanup scanned count to track only .upload files.\nDocs updated in README.md, ROADMAP.md, AGENTS.md, OPTIMIZATIONS.md.","tree":{"sha":"d5701e5a55502ad66dd99629b53e6d7ba16d8bb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/d5701e5a55502ad66dd99629b53e6d7ba16d8bb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52","node_id":"C_kwDOQpRgi9oAKDE1NzM2NjA1MzQwZWUzOTA3ZDllNGE0YmU2YThiNTA0YTY4ODVkNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr/representative-party-web/commit/9a7ac5ff7430a8842ad38c0e02f1c08cc44b97ce","sha":"9a7ac5ff7430a8842ad38c0e02f1c08cc44b97ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/9a7ac5ff7430a8842ad38c0e02f1c08cc44b97ce"}],"sha":"15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/15736605340ee3907d9e4a4be6a8b504a6885d52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/commits/9a7ac5ff7430a8842ad38c0e02f1c08cc44b97ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-08T16:30:19Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-08T16:30:19Z","email":"rcecchini.ds@gmail.com","name":"Riccardo Cecchini"},"message":"Added multipart field-name and header caps, plus integration tests for field-total/field-count limits and scheduled cleanup behavior. Full test suite is green.\n\nWhat changed\n\nrequest.js: enforce field-name byte limits and per-part header byte caps; carry new errors through both streaming and buffered parsing.\nsocial.js: pass new limits and return 413s for field_name_too_large and headers_too_large.\nconfig.js: add SOCIAL_MEDIA_FIELD_NAME_MAX_BYTES + SOCIAL_MEDIA_HEADER_MAX_BYTES defaults/envs.\nmultipart-limits.test.js: new integration tests for total field bytes, field count caps, and periodic cleanup.\nDocs: README.md, ROADMAP.md, .env.example, OPTIMIZATIONS.md updated to reflect the new guards and completed backlog item.","tree":{"sha":"3b7ce4b35334838fbcb2243147cef759765a81b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/trees/3b7ce4b35334838fbcb2243147cef759765a81b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cekkr/representative-party-web/git/commits/9a7ac5ff7430a8842ad38c0e02f1c08cc44b97ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16149805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cekkr","id":16149805,"login":"cekkr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTQ5ODA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cekkr","user_view_type":