s://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/26d8e86996c6b38d9610befbb2cc0a9945fabba4","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDI2ZDhlODY5OTZjNmIzOGQ5NjEwYmVmYmIyY2MwYTk5NDVmYWJiYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/5ca2f0f1388bc50b6b505f4dbb428e7bd76085ad","sha":"5ca2f0f1388bc50b6b505f4dbb428e7bd76085ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/5ca2f0f1388bc50b6b505f4dbb428e7bd76085ad"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d","sha":"2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d"}],"sha":"26d8e86996c6b38d9610befbb2cc0a9945fabba4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/26d8e86996c6b38d9610befbb2cc0a9945fabba4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:02:53Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:02:53Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"message":"Fix: 그리드 패키지를 0.2.6 으로 올리고 드러난 타입 오류와 셀 서식 버그 수정 [ITSM-2026-123123]\n\ngrid-vue 0.2.6(core 0.1.54, wrapper 0.1.19)으로 올렸다. 중첩 SplitPane 의 slot 충돌과\n마운트 직후 데이터가 그리드에 들어가지 않던 문제가 패키지에서 고쳐졌다.\n\n0.2.6 부터 그리드 타입 선언이 정상으로 잡혀, 그동안 any 로 가려졌던 오류 20건이 드러났다.\n- cellAttributes 콜백이 행 데이터를 row 가 아니라 rowData 로 받아 항상 undefined 였다.\n  계획 재실행의 수량·단계·수정 셀 강조, New RTF 의 행·비율 클래스가 실제로 적용되지 않았다.\n- LoadFactorByOperGroupSub3·PlanDashboardSettings 필드에 필수인 dataType 이 없었다.\n- 타입 없이 선언한 필드 배열에서 dataType 리터럴이 string 으로 넓어졌다 → FieldDef[] 등으로 타입을 붙였다.\n- 그리드 인스턴스를 ref 로 담아 TS2589 가 났다 → shallowRef 로 바꿨다.\n- Product 를 type 별칭으로 바꿔 그리드 data 에 넣을 수 있게 했다.\n\n가이드(04)에 cellAttributes 인자 이름과 필드 배열 타입 주의를 추가했다.","tree":{"sha":"1fbae18c0fd1bb3f5be37f30bd1b5e6a6e195f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/1fbae18c0fd1bb3f5be37f30bd1b5e6a6e195f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDJlOGNiNDBiMWViNDdkZDQ5ZWE3NGY0MTYyMGQyMDRhOGU0ZTFmNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67","sha":"6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67"}],"sha":"2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/2e8cb40b1eb47dd49ea74f41620d204a8e4e1f6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:50:26Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:50:26Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"message":"Fix: 신규 컴포넌트 스타일이 깨지고 차트가 그려지지 않던 문제 수정 [ITSM-2026-123123]\n\n브라우저에서 dev 실행으로 확인한 문제를 고쳤다.\n\n- 전역 리셋(DeveloperTool/styles/_base.scss)이 레이어 밖에 있어 @layer moz 인 컴포넌트 스타일을 덮었다.\n  리셋을 @layer reset 으로 감싸고, 가장 먼저 로드하는 styles/layer-order.css 에서 reset < moz 순서를 선언했다.\n- 슬롯 내용이 <span data-moz-slot> 래퍼 안에 들어가 Controller #action 같은 flex 영역에서 세로로 쌓였다.\n  styles/moz-overrides.css 에서 래퍼를 display: contents 로 바꿔 레거시처럼 부모 레이아웃에 참여하게 했다.\n- SalesChart·ProductionByProcess 의 onInitialized 에서 차트 분류·유형 setter 를 호출하면 정의가 계속 재초기화돼\n  차트가 비었다. 레거시에서 아무 효과가 없던 대입문이었으므로 호출을 지웠다.","tree":{"sha":"88f6f8c228e06d56657b71ab65227746ab55a58a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/88f6f8c228e06d56657b71ab65227746ab55a58a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDYyNTdmYjczNmNiNTIxZjAwMjU0Y2VjZWJkNWY1YWE3NTBkMTZjNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/41a2089167ff09d1afdc7fc577948d41dfe12f97","sha":"41a2089167ff09d1afdc7fc577948d41dfe12f97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/41a2089167ff09d1afdc7fc577948d41dfe12f97"}],"sha":"6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/6257fb736cb521f00254cecebd5f5aa750d16c67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/41a2089167ff09d1afdc7fc577948d41dfe12f97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:17:20Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T09:17:20Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"message":"Feat: UI 패키지를 public npm 신규 트랙으로 전환하고 Wijmo 제거 [ITSM-2026-123123]\n\nGitHub Packages 에서만 받던 레거시 패키지 3종을 public npm 패키지로 교체했다.\n이제 토큰이나 레지스트리 설정 없이 pnpm install 로 설치된다.\n\n- 의존성: moz-ui-components → moz-ui-components-vue, moz-wijmo-grid → moz-ui-grid-vue(MozGrid),\n  moz-ui-chart → moz-ui-chart-vue. 스타일용으로 moz-ui-components-core, moz-ui-grid-wrapper 를 직접 의존에 추가했다.\n- 화면: 모든 ExtendFlexGrid·ExtendPivotGrid 를 MozGrid(flat/pivot)로 다시 작성하고 Wijmo import·CSS 를 제거했다.\n  고유 키가 없는 데이터는 행 순번 키를 붙여 keyFields 로 쓴다.\n- shim: src/shims/moz-wijmo-grid 를 src/shims/grid 로 옮기고, createColumnMapForExport 가 필드 배열을 받도록 바꿨다.\n- 빌드·배포: Dockerfile·deploy-custom-ui.ps1·onprem-build-push.ps1 에서 npm 토큰 처리를 없애고,\n  Wijmo 라이선스 패치 스크립트를 삭제했다.\n- 라우터에 연결되지 않은 sp/example 사본을 삭제했다.\n- 가이드·TRAINING·README·add-page 커맨드를 MozGrid 와 npm 설치 기준으로 고쳤다.","tree":{"sha":"cdd799c13f49eafc909e530356dfa1fa1d86a6fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/cdd799c13f49eafc909e530356dfa1fa1d86a6fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/41a2089167ff09d1afdc7fc577948d41dfe12f97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_eve