github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/288418392b620fe12adfd0c1f24676d3a5f1bc4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:23:45Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:23:45Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"message":"Fix: loadLanguageFromHost 를 dev 단독 실행용으로 되살림 [ITSM-2026-001701]\n\nloadLanguageFromHost 는 용어관리 DB 번역을 받아오는 함수라, json 다국어를 폐기한 뒤\ndev 단독 실행에서 그대로 쓸 수 있다. Host 경로 호출만 없애면 되므로 함수는 되살리고,\n로컬 개발자 인증 방식이 정해지면 bootstrap.ts 에서 호출한다는 주석을 달았다.","tree":{"sha":"b31e78351b3df864eea536de06068c040bb4de86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/b31e78351b3df864eea536de06068c040bb4de86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/288418392b620fe12adfd0c1f24676d3a5f1bc4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/288418392b620fe12adfd0c1f24676d3a5f1bc4d","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDI4ODQxODM5MmI2MjBmZTEyYWRmZDBjMWYyNDY3NmQzYTVmMWJjNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/6e1187974092788660c6207c955dec28fd16933a","sha":"6e1187974092788660c6207c955dec28fd16933a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/6e1187974092788660c6207c955dec28fd16933a"}],"sha":"288418392b620fe12adfd0c1f24676d3a5f1bc4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/288418392b620fe12adfd0c1f24676d3a5f1bc4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/faysia320","id":10287272,"login":"faysia320","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjg3Mjcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/6e1187974092788660c6207c955dec28fd16933a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:13:03Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T08:13:03Z","email":"faysia320@gmail.com","name":"Rocket"},"message":"Fix: Host 환경에서 리모트 화면이 Host i18next 로만 번역되도록 정리 [ITSM-2026-001701]\n\nHost 에 마운트된 리모트 화면의 useTranslation()·$t 는 Host 앱의 i18next 를 쓰는데,\nensureRemoteI18n 은 쓰이지 않는 리모트 i18next 사본에 번역을 넣고 있었다.\n리모트 사본을 직접 쓰는 코드는 화면 갱신과 연결되지 않아 첫 진입 때 번역이 반영되지 않고\n다른 메뉴로 이동해야 바뀌었다(VisionOX 보고 현상).\n\n- expose.ts 의 ensureRemoteI18n 과 plugins/i18n.ts 의 loadLanguageFromHost 를 제거했다.\n- useQtyUomQuery 가 i18next 를 직접 import 하던 것을 useTranslation() + computed 로 바꿨다.\n- 가이드에 i18next 직접 import 금지 규칙과 용어관리 키 등록 절차를 추가하고, ADR-0003 에 개정을 기록했다.","tree":{"sha":"e08ce24aa0a7616bfc161310abf6882dec4c23c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/e08ce24aa0a7616bfc161310abf6882dec4c23c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/6e1187974092788660c6207c955dec28fd16933a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10287272?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/faysia320/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/f