4+Jake-kim-sang-hyun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake-kim-sang-hyun"},"message":"docs: LLM 코딩 행동 지침 CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md 추가\n\nClaude Code(CLAUDE.md)와 Codex CLI(AGENTS.md)가 각자의 관례 파일로\n동일한 행동 지침을 읽도록 루트에 추가.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3db5a66a2018c79c47ee96de8bb82a4a474cbb48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/3db5a66a2018c79c47ee96de8bb82a4a474cbb48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/eb05ec1455fc7e1f5ed2f58481fa309eb25c9bbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147456354?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jake-kim-sang-hyun","id":147456354,"login":"Jake-kim-sang-hyun","node_id":"U_kgDOCMoBYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/eb05ec1455fc7e1f5ed2f58481fa309eb25c9bbc","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKGViMDVlYzE0NTVmYzdlMWY1ZWQyZjU4NDgxZmEzMDllYjI1YzliYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/3c11f7b15db4fad4939b3665a66a2dee31f38b4e","sha":"3c11f7b15db4fad4939b3665a66a2dee31f38b4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/3c11f7b15db4fad4939b3665a66a2dee31f38b4e"}],"sha":"eb05ec1455fc7e1f5ed2f58481fa309eb25c9bbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/eb05ec1455fc7e1f5ed2f58481fa309eb25c9bbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147456354?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jake-kim-sang-hyun","id":147456354,"login":"Jake-kim-sang-hyun","node_id":"U_kgDOCMoBYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/3c11f7b15db4fad4939b3665a66a2dee31f38b4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T04:56:26Z","email":"147456354+Jake-kim-sang-hyun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake-kim-sang-hyun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T05:14:08Z","email":"147456354+Jake-kim-sang-hyun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jake-kim-sang-hyun"},"message":"Chore: 내부 MCP 서버(github/postgres)를 local 스코프로 분리 + 공개 도구만 커밋\n\n이 저장소는 공개 레포라, 내부 DB 종류·개수·이름이 .mcp.json 에 드러나면 안 됨.\n내부 서버는 커밋되지 않는 local 스코프(~/.claude.json, 레포 밖)에만 등록한다.\n\n- 공개 .mcp.json: 범용 도구만 (chrome-devtools, sequential-thinking, playwright, serena)\n- tools/setup-local-mcp.ps1 (make mcp-local): .env 를 읽어 내부 서버를 local 스코프 등록.\n  - 서버 정의·DB 이름·개수는 전부 .env 에서만 옴 (스크립트엔 하드코딩 없음).\n  - 비밀은 {{VAR}} 플레이스홀더로만 등록되고 런타임에 mcp-launch.mjs 가 .env 에서 주입\n    → ~/.claude.json 에도 비밀이 저장되지 않음.\n- tools/mcp-launch.mjs: .env 로드 + {{VAR}} 치환 런처 (Claude Code 의 ${VAR} 와 구분).\n- .env.example: 공개 안전한 일반 템플릿 (실제 이름/개수 미노출). 실제 .env 는 gitignore.\n- tools/package.json: playwright/github/postgres MCP 패키지 핀 고정 (node 로 실행).\n- check-prereqs.ps1: .env / make mcp-local 안내 추가.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"583c019cbfdc949e5d24a29d0cb759b807f493f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/583c019cbfdc949e5d24a29d0cb759b807f493f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/3c11f7b15db4fad4939b3665a66a2dee31f38b4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147456354?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jake-kim-sang-hyun","id":147456354,"login":"Jake-kim-sang-hyun","node_id":"U_kgDOCMoBYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-kim-sang-hyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscript