edPlanResult 새탭 열기 쿼리에 region 이\n빠져 있어, 대시보드의 region 선택값과 무관하게 RTF 리포트는 항상 기본 region\n으로 떠 값 불일치가 발생했다.\n\nusePlanDashboard inject 에서 region 도 destructure 받고, rtfReportRegion\ncomputed 추가:\n  - ''RTF'' 또는 null/undefined → ''default''\n  - ''RTF_xxx''                 → ''xxx''\n\nopenLinkNewTab 쿼리에 region 동봉.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b6893a742e33550596b1579f4abbce2de9834cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/1b6893a742e33550596b1579f4abbce2de9834cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/b6b696adb9d16f6e3f4bb1f1f4cb9a4cecc2f125","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/b6b696adb9d16f6e3f4bb1f1f4cb9a4cecc2f125","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKGI2YjY5NmFkYjlkMTZmNmUzZjRiYjFmMWY0Y2I5YTRjZWNjMmYxMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564","sha":"7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564"}],"sha":"b6b696adb9d16f6e3f4bb1f1f4cb9a4cecc2f125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/b6b696adb9d16f6e3f4bb1f1f4cb9a4cecc2f125"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:40:39Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T02:40:39Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Feat: LoadFactorByOperGroup 세부데이터 Excel 다운로드 구현\n\n원본 APS excelStore.ts:download 와 동일한 철학 — \"백엔드가 xlsx 생성, 프론트는\nPOST + saveAs\". 원본의 ExcelQueueManager / SSE / S3 / 잠금 등 인프라는\ncustom-ui-templates 범위에서 불필요하므로 생략.\n\n프론트:\n- shim @vmscloud/moz-wijmo-grid/excel.ts 신규: downloadBigData(param) — 원본\n  queryStore.downloadBigData 와 동일 시그니처. 내부는 axios POST(blob) → file-saver\n  saveAs. createColumnMapForExport(grid) 도 함께 제공.\n- store.ts shim 확장: useExcelStore 에 excelFileMap / exportFormat /\n  createColumnMapForExport 추가.\n- vite alias / 타입 선언 추가.\n- file-saver, @types/file-saver 의존성 추가.\n- LoadFactorByOperGroup.vue: downloadExcelData stub 제거하고 downloadBigData 호출.\n  Sub3 grid ref 가 부모로 노출되지 않아 LOAD_FACTOR_DETAIL_COLUMN_MAP 정적 상수로\n  14컬럼 매핑.\n\n백엔드:\n- pyproject.toml: openpyxl>=3.1.0 추가.\n- load_factor.py: POST /detail-excel 엔드포인트. column_map + data_parameter 받아\n  httpx 로 C# RarStrByOperGroup/Detail 호출 → JSON → openpyxl Workbook → BytesIO →\n  StreamingResponse. Content-Disposition 으로 파일명 전달 (RFC5987 한글 안전).\n  세션 cookie/authorization 헤더 그대로 forward.\n- aps_proxy.py: load-factor-detail route 추가 (단순 JSON proxy 용도, xlsx 엔드포인트\n  와는 별도. 향후 다른 페이지에서 raw JSON 필요 시 활용).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08b0a411ebc448a8c6b6cbd211df677ef9f120e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/08b0a411ebc448a8c6b6cbd211df677ef9f120e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDdlMzFlMDQwMDdlY2JiZGZlOGFmNDgyOTZkZjkyOTI5MDNhNjk1NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/8fa05ed172238a079c0e30b09c7218f2d45264a9","sha":"8fa05ed172238a079c0e30b09c7218f2d45264a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/8fa05ed172238a079c0e30b09c7218f2d45264a9"}],"sha":"7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7e31e04007ecbbdfe8af48296df9292903a69564"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/8fa05ed172238a079c0e30b09c7218f2d45264a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T06:12:26Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T09:02:29Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"UX: 계획재실행 팝업 — 확정 버튼 loading + 탭 그리드 스크롤 원본 구조 재현\n\n- isExecuting ref 추가, onClickConfirm 의 postReExecutePlan 호출을 try/finally 로 감싸\n  버튼 moz Button 의 :loading / :disabled 에 바인딩. 실행 중 스피너 표시.\n- Inbound tree / Engine global / Engine module 3개 multi-row 그리드의 높이를\n  computeAutoHeight(rowCount) 로 명시 계산해서 그리드 내부 scroll 을 제거.\n  outer wrapper 의 overflow: auto 에서만 스크롤 — 원본 ExecutionFlowMasterDetailSummary\n  와 동일한 UX. Inbound tree 는 Category + 확장된 Menu children 까지 합산.\n\nFeat: 계획 재실행 팝업 — 선택된 Flow 상세 탭(인바운드/엔진/아웃바운드) 이식\n\n원본 ExecutionFlowMasterDetailSummary.vue 의 3탭 구조를 포팅:\n- Inbound 탭: step/ref data/tree(OPER RES PROP VALUE 등)/data storage 4그리드.\n  PlmInboundScenarioMaster/Config 프록시 추가 + Category 트리화 + Y/N→boolean 변환.\n  use_aps_data/use_ver_data 분기, menuID hidden, wj-align-center + span color formatItem.\n- Engine 탭: step/global config/module 3그리드. uiType/ui_type === ''TOGGLE'' 분기로\n  IconCheck/IconClose 렌더. engineFormatItem: description i18n 번역 + union-null\n  (max_phase 초과 phase) + error-mark (DefaultRuleSet 빈 셀). onInitializedScenarioModule\n  로 AllowMerging.All + 첫 컬럼 merge.\n- Outbound 탭: outboundID 유무를 IconCheck/IconClose 로.\n\n토글과 무관하게 항상 노출 (운영 동작 기준). IconCheck 아이콘은 moz-shared shims 에 신규.\n\nPerf: 계획재실행 pivot 그리드 렌더 구간 overlay 스피너 + formatItem 핫패스 최적화\n\nisPivotRendering 플래그 추가. fetch 시작부터 pivot 의 첫 loadedRows 이벤트까지\n유지해, HTTP fetch 완료 후에도 Wijmo PivotEngine 동기 집계가 끝날 때까지\nv-memo 밖 overlay 로 덮는다. 데이터 empty/에러 시 즉시 해제.\n\nExtendPivotGrid 내장 loading/emptyState 는 v-memo 에 갇혀 반응성이 깨지므로\n상수 false 로 고정하고, 스피너 UX 는 전적으로 외부 overlay 로 대체.\n\npivotFormatItem 핫패스 최적화:\n- regex(RE_DATE/RE_TEXT_DATE/RE_KO_DATE/RE_LEADING_DIGIT_PREFIX) 모듈 스코프로 승격\n- Intl.NumberFormat 단일 인스턴스 재사용 (toLocaleString 옵션 매번 할당 제거)\n- columnHeaderDateCache 로 컬럼 헤더 날짜 파싱 캐싱, loadedRows 마다 무효화\n- 첫 글자 charCode 체크로 숫자 후보 셀만 Number() 파싱 시도\n- 월 헤더 DOM 변환 guard (include-qty-uom 클래스 있으면 재구성 skip)\n- DIFF 행 분기 순서 재배치로 불필요 조건 함수 호출 감소\n\nFix: 계획재실행 팝업 — 팝업 오픈 시 상세 재조회 + 엔진 scenarioID 필드명 교정\n\n- 팝업이 열릴 때 현재 선택된 flow 기준으로 scenario-config / scenario-modules /\n  inbound-scenario-config 를 재조회하도록 reloadExecutionFlowDetail 추가.\n  원본 ExecutionFlowMasterDetailSummary 는 팝업 sub 컴포넌트 마운트 시 immediate\n  watch 로 호출되지만, 포팅본은 composable 스코프 watch 라 ID 가 onMounted 에서\n  이미 세팅되면 재발사되지 않아 팝업 열 때 상세가 비어있었음.\n- executionFlowID / isAdvancedOption 변경 시에도 상세 재조회. Simple/Advanced 모드\n  토글 포함.\n- loadScenarioConfig 에 scenarioIDOverride 파라미터 추가. Simple 모드에선\n  reExecuteState.scenarioID 가 갱신되지 않아 flow.engine_scenario_id 를 직접 주입.\n\n- 팝업의 executionFlowDataResult computed 가 엔진 시나리오를 scenario_id 로 찾고\n  있었는데 실제 필드는 engine_scenario_id. 그래서 scenarioID 가 항상 빈 값이 되어\n  엔진/아웃바운드 탭의 2·3번째 그리드가 v-if 에 걸려 전부 hidden 처리됐다. 필드\n  우선순위를 engine_scenario_id → scenario_id → engineScenarioID → scenarioID 순으로 교정.\n\n- loadInboundItemOptions: 원본 menuListToTree 와 동일하게 multilingual 필드\n  세팅 (Category → t(optionID), cfg_/ope_ prefix → t(''text-global-upper-*'')) + seq 정렬 +\n  parent.children 에 optionValue true 가 있으면 parent 도 true.\n- IconCheck 추가 (moz-shared shims) — 원본 트리 그리드 optionValue 표기에 사용.\n\n- 인바운드/엔진/아웃바운드 SCSS 를 원본 그대로 옮김: flex-direction: column 으로\n  그리드 세로 stack, outer-wrapper overflow: auto, item height: fit-content.\n- 한 행짜리 그리드(step, ref_data, data_storage, outbound)에 single-row-grid\n  클래스 적용해 72px 고정 높이로 원본과 동일한 compact 표시.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd7d0a9c2a952239d9f5be5cb38bdde8aa2f3a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/cd7d0a9c2a952239d9f5be5cb38bdde8aa2f3a7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/8fa05ed172238a079c0e30b09c7218f2d45264a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,