"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/46bc5473ab8395deee1acd4c86f8619960750930/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T09:17:27Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T09:17:27Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: ui_backend.yml 에 TRINO_HOST/PORT/USER 필수 변수 추가\n\nbackend .env 파일을 이미지에서 제외(.dockerignore) 한 이후 Settings 검증\n단계에서 TRINO_HOST / TRINO_USER 가 누락되어 uvicorn 부팅이 즉시 실패\n(pydantic ValidationError)하는 문제.\n\nui_backend.yml 의 environment 에 TRINO_HOST/TRINO_PORT/TRINO_USER 를\n추가. 기본값은 기존 .env 값 유지(203.231.40.243 / 18080 / mzcadm)하고\n스택 배포 시 ${TRINO_HOST:-...} 로 override 가능.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9098509aad28dae9ead5c84b3129a082f84e9d29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/9098509aad28dae9ead5c84b3129a082f84e9d29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/46bc5473ab8395deee1acd4c86f8619960750930","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/46bc5473ab8395deee1acd4c86f8619960750930","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDQ2YmM1NDczYWI4Mzk1ZGVlZTFhY2Q0Yzg2Zjg2MTk5NjA3NTA5MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939","sha":"35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939"}],"sha":"46bc5473ab8395deee1acd4c86f8619960750930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/46bc5473ab8395deee1acd4c86f8619960750930"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T09:12:36Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T09:12:36Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: backend .env 파일이 이미지에 포함되던 문제 — .dockerignore 추가\n\nDockerfile 의 COPY . . 에 .env 가 걸려 로컬 개발용\nAPS_BACKEND_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080 이 컨테이너 이미지에\n고정되어 들어감. 운영에서 OS 환경변수(APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL=http://apigw)\n가 pydantic-settings 기본 우선순위로 dotenv 를 이겨야 하지만,\n이미지에 박힌 .env 구조 자체가 디버깅 혼선의 원인이었다.\n\nbackend/.dockerignore 신설하여 .env / .env.* 는 이미지에 포함하지 않음\n(.env.example 만 허용). 더불어 __pycache__, .venv, .git, IDE 파일,\n로컬 실행 스크립트 등도 제외해 이미지 슬림화.\n\n재배포 후 컨테이너에는 .env 가 없고 OS 환경변수(스택 yml 주입값)만\n적용되므로 APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL=http://apigw 가 그대로 반영된다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1591f9788b0a4c0c9c4b172dcdb98bd915eaf1cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/1591f9788b0a4c0c9c4b172dcdb98bd915eaf1cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDM1YTdhODI3ZmY4MWZjNTgxM2E5ODJhZjMyMzM4NjM4YjRmNGY5Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65","sha":"815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65"}],"sha":"35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/35a7a827ff81fc5813a982af32338638b4f4f939"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:49:14Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:58:44Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: APS 프록시 upstream 설정 정비 (APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL)\n\n/api/custom/backend/.../proxy/* 호출이 운영에서 502 로 떨어지던 이슈\n(APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL 미주입 → httpx.ConnectError) 정리. 아래 4개 파일을\n하나의 변경으로 묶어 반영.\n\n- ui_backend.yml\n    APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL 항목 추가. 기본값은 mzc_network overlay 내부\n    APS 백엔드 서비스 alias 가정값 http://mzc_aps_backend:5000.\n    포트/이름이 환경마다 다르면 배포 시 override 가능하도록\n    ${APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL:-...} 사용.\n- backend/.env.example\n    예시 주석을 mzc_aps_backend 기반으로 정렬. 외부 HTTPS 예시도 유지.\n- backend/app/core/config.py\n    Settings.APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL 주석을 같은 예시로 갱신.\n- backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/aps_proxy.py\n    httpx.ConnectError / 기타 예외 응답에 원인 설명 포함, DEBUG=true 인\n    경우 target URL 과 detail 을 함께 반환하여 차후 동일 이슈 즉시 식별.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3cd083469e28ed7ea231accf9bebc1f55f19027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/d3cd083469e28ed7ea231accf9bebc1f55f19027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDgxNTA0OWZjNTdlYWJmZTQzYTQxMjM0NjdjYTU3NTUwNzVlZThhNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/037efd0a759ceb9c6b896079e9314145b8a84976","sha":"037efd0a759ceb9c6b896079e9314145b8a84976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/037efd0a759ceb9c6b896079e9314145b8a84976"}],"sha":"815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/815049fc57eabfe43a4123467ca5755075ee8a65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/037efd0a759ceb9c6b896079e9314145b8a84976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:30:44Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:30:44Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: PlanDashboard 가로 오버플로 — grid columns / panel min-width 제약\n\n.panel 의 min-width: 514px 와 grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) 이\n결합되어 3개 패널 최소폭 합(≈1586px) 이 content-section 의 가용 폭을\n초과, 우측으로 삐져나가 보이던 문제.\n\n- grid-template-columns 를 repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)) 로 변경해 컬럼이\n  컨테이너 폭을 넘기지 않도록 함.\n- .panel min-width 를 0 으로 내려 grid item 이 축소 허용.\n- .content-section 좌우 padding 대칭(20/20), overflow-x: hidden 명시,\n  box-sizing: border-box 보강.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08b46e7780c985791a7e4bc9bff85cb0e990e8dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/08b46e7780c985791a7e4bc9bff85cb0e990e8dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/037efd0a759ceb9c6b896079e9314145b8a84976","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su