count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:27:17Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: Module Federation 엔트리 파일 캐시 헤더 교정\n\nnginx.conf 의 정적 파일 location 이 .js 확장자 전체에 immutable + 1y 를\n걸어버려 이름이 고정인 /ext/remoteEntry.js 와 /ext/index.html 까지\n브라우저/중간 CDN 이 영구 캐시. 배포 후에도 옛 remoteEntry.js 가\n남아 그 안에 적힌 예전 해시를 따라가다 /ext/assets/*.js 가 404 가\n되어 리모트 화면이 통째로 비어버리는 회귀가 발생.\n\n수정:\n- /ext/remoteEntry.js 와 /ext/index.html 은 no-store, must-revalidate\n  로 매 요청 재검증.\n- 해시가 붙은 /ext/assets/*.{js,css,...} 만 immutable + 1y 유지.\n- 기타 이미지/폰트는 1시간 짧은 캐시.\n\n배포 후 강력 새로고침 없이도 리모트가 정상 동작하도록.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6aafdc731c1f4a5b84d5a4f64ba4f1aa183f0b19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/6aafdc731c1f4a5b84d5a4f64ba4f1aa183f0b19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/21c9cd90f283e30ddbc7dafe810dfbbce204e7a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/21c9cd90f283e30ddbc7dafe810dfbbce204e7a6","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDIxYzljZDkwZjI4M2UzMGRkYmM3ZGFmZTgxMGRmYmJjZTIwNGU3YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2","sha":"7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2"}],"sha":"21c9cd90f283e30ddbc7dafe810dfbbce204e7a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/21c9cd90f283e30ddbc7dafe810dfbbce204e7a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:13:37Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T08:13:37Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: async setup 제거 — 리모트 화면이 빈 상태로 마운트되던 문제\n\n직전 i18n 수정에서 withHostInit 의 setup 을 async 로 바꾸면서\nhost 의 RemoteLoader 가 <Suspense> 경계를 제공하지 않는 상태라\n리모트 컴포넌트가 전혀 마운트되지 않고 화면이 빈 상태로 남음.\n\n해결: setup 을 다시 동기로 되돌리고 ensureRemoteI18n 은 fire-and-forget\n으로 호출한다. i18next.addResourceBundle 이후 languageChanged 이벤트가\n발생하면 i18next-vue 가 reactive 하게 라벨을 갱신하므로 번역 동작은\n문제 없음.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a88c771d4df99f961ca79fe296f49011f51eea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/8a88c771d4df99f961ca79fe296f49011f51eea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDc0OTZkOGQyODEzMGNlZjE0MTRmYjBlYjJjM2I5ZDBlYWE3MzI0ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/849e66070ee7e3fe14cdbc3a59af18f87f711665","sha":"849e66070ee7e3fe14cdbc3a59af18f87f711665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/849e66070ee7e3fe14cdbc3a59af18f87f711665"}],"sha":"7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7496d8d28130cef1414fb0eb2c3b9d0eaa7324e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/849e66070ee7e3fe14cdbc3a59af18f87f711665/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T07:49:56Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T07:49:56Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: Module Federation 호스트 환경 i18n 번역 로드\n\n리모트가 호스트(Module Federation)로 로드될 때 bootstrap.ts 가 실행되지 않아\n리모트 i18next 에 번역 번들이 비어있었고, 결과적으로\ntext-default_uom / text-conversion_uom 같은 키가 t() 에서 빈 값으로\n돌아와 UOM Select 의 displayValue 가 공백이 되는 문제.\n\n원본 APS packages/aps/src/utils/i18n.ts 의 loadLanguage 와 동일 패턴으로\nAPS SamLanguage API 로부터 번역을 리모트 i18next 에 주입해 해결.\n\n- plugins/i18n.ts: loadLanguageFromHost(projectId, lang) 추가.\n  `/api/aps/backend/<pid>/SamLanguage/<lang>` 호출 후\n  sys → ''sy'' namespace, lang → 해당 언어 namespace 로 addResourceBundle.\n- expose.ts: withHostInit 의 setup 첫 실행 시 ensureRemoteI18n 을\n  한 번만 실행해 언어 리소스를 주입. 언어 우선순위는\n  hostData.projectInfo.userInfo.language → navigator.language → ''ko''.\n\n호스트 i18next 인스턴스를 덮어쓰지 않고 리모트 자기 인스턴스에만\naddResourceBundle 하므로 타 메뉴에 영향 없음. 세션이 없는 dev 단독\n실행에서는 호출이 401 로 실패하며 정적 JSON(bootstrap.ts 초기 init)\n을 fallback 으로 유지.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a74f56cb5beea361555dc5340f9e9747a3fbad72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/a74f56cb5beea361555dc5340f9e9747a3fbad72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/849e66070ee7e3fe14cdbc3a59af18f87f711665","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users