84625aea44d9e38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/446f088e19f74a8b2f23024f184625aea44d9e38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/6aa90159d51be37c249cc934093d59fee47b7af7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T05:35:32Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T05:35:32Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Docs: 개발자 가이드(docs/guide/) 11챕터 신규 작성\n\n새 페이지를 처음부터 만드는 개발자 시점으로 구성:\n- 01 overview: 저장소로 만들 수 있는 것, 실행 환경 3종\n- 02 environment-setup: dev 서버, 포트, mock 모드\n- 03 architecture: Host ↔ MF remote ↔ FastAPI ↔ PG/Trino 흐름, API 이원화\n- 04 frontend-guide: 폴더 관례, 공용 훅, expose.ts, shim\n- 05 backend-guide: FastAPI 구조, 서비스·어댑터·SQL 템플릿, 페이지 순회 헬퍼\n- 06 creating-a-page: 화면 + 엔드포인트를 처음부터 만드는 실전 예제(Work Order)\n- 07 data-sources: PG / Trino / APS Host API 선택 기준, Trino 타입/페이지네이션 주의\n- 08 ui-patterns: Controller · Wijmo 그리드/피벗 · 팝업 · Step 마법사 · SplitPane\n- 09 i18n-uom-datetime: 번역 키 규칙, useQtyUomQuery, Dayjs 규칙\n- 10 debugging: 네트워크/_debug 필드/타이밍 가드/SQL 진단 체크리스트\n- 11 reference: 공용 훅·아이콘·환경변수·경로·컨벤션 한 장 요약\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"903eba1e322c812906da2daac34cba5180e8a9c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/903eba1e322c812906da2daac34cba5180e8a9c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/6aa90159d51be37c249cc934093d59fee47b7af7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/6aa90159d51be37c249cc934093d59fee47b7af7","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDZhYTkwMTU5ZDUxYmUzN2MyNDljYzkzNDA5M2Q1OWZlZTQ3YjdhZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/ce915d2aa4ae29b3aea388efc596fd16a96d4147","sha":"ce915d2aa4ae29b3aea388efc596fd16a96d4147","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/c