ERSION\" 영문 하드코딩 → computed + t(\"text-default_uom\")/t(\"text-conversion_uom\") 로 변경. 다른 공용 훅(useQtyUomQuery) 사용 페이지와 동일하게 EA/㎡ 표기 일치.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"158a15a5206d3d7e51eab21049bc77688b3c0de9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/158a15a5206d3d7e51eab21049bc77688b3c0de9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/ce915d2aa4ae29b3aea388efc596fd16a96d4147","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/ce915d2aa4ae29b3aea388efc596fd16a96d4147","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKGNlOTE1ZDJhYTRhZTI5YjNhZWEzODhlZmM1OTZmZDE2YTk2ZDQxNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/ca9d7cb88a110d034d00766889c94d0719b04ab6","sha":"ca9d7cb88a110d034d00766889c94d0719b04ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/ca9d7cb88a110d034d00766889c94d0719b04ab6"}],"sha":"ce915d2aa4ae29b3aea388efc596fd16a96d4147","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/ce915d2aa4ae29b3aea388efc596fd16a96d4147"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/ca9d7cb88a110d034d00766889c94d0719b04ab6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T01:16:48Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T01:16:48Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: 계획 재실행 — 값 정밀도 / 팝업 데이터·아이콘 정합\n\nMain 데이터\n- 피벗 qty의 중간 round(x, 2)를 제거하고 원본 C#처럼 double 누적. 표시 단(Wijmo format=\"n2\")에서만 반올림해 원본과 소수 2자리 동일.\n\n버전 정보 팝업\n- /re-execute-plan/plan-cycle-info (cfg_plan_config + cfg_plan_cycle_info), /re-execute-plan/demand-vers (cfg_demand_ver) 직접 조회 엔드포인트 신설.\n- 프론트 fetchPlanCycleInfo/fetchDemandVer를 proxy 대신 신규 엔드포인트로 호출. planVer watcher에서 cycle 정보 + demand 버전 순차 로드.\n- demandVerInfo computed를 demandVerSource 최신 항목으로 교체.\n\n재실행 팝업 엔진 탭\n- reExecuteState.startDate 타입을 Date → Dayjs로 교체 (.format/.add 런타임 에러 해결).\n- ReExecutePlanPop.vue의 로컬 reExecuteState가 period:7을 하드코딩하던 것을 composable과 동일하게 dayjs()/getDaysUntilEndOfMonth(오늘)로 정정.\n- 실행 플로우 상세 보기 영역 하단에 원본 시나리오 모듈 그리드(module_id / description / phaseColumns) 복원.\n\n팝업 상단 수요 버전 표시\n- ReExecutePlan.vue에서 :demandVer를 reExecuteState.demandVer(사용자 입력 빈값) 대신 demandVerSource[0].demand_ver로 fallback.\n\n아이콘 원본 복원\n- shims/moz-shared/icons에 IconLineEdit / IconReExecute / IconDataCheck / IconResultCheck SVG 복제.\n- 메인 페이지 \"버전 정보\" / \"계획 재실행\" 버튼과 팝업 step1/step2 탭 아이콘을 원본과 동일하게 교체.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f0737195738e28bde6a2a9050817e088a6d4d94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/8f0737195738e28bde6a2a9050817e088a6d4d94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/ca9d7cb88a110d034d00766889c94d0719b04ab6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_vie