14T06:11:13Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T06:11:13Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: Re-execute Plan 백엔드+프론트 전면 수정\n\n백엔드 Main API (C# GetReExecutePlanDatas 포팅):\n- frozen_ver 조회: C# GetFrozenPlanVer 로직 (plan_cycle 내 FROZEN 상태)\n- plan+frozen 병렬 쿼리 → merge → FillEmptyCell → CalculateDiff\n- plan/frozen/diff 3종 plan_type flat list 반환\n- aggregateType(itemGroup/cust/region/demandType) → composite key 분기\n- cycle dates 기반 날짜 범위 필터\n\nSQL 필드명 프론트 binding 일치:\n- plan_date→date, plan_month→month, plan_week→week\n- planType→plan_type (snake_case)\n- rpt_buffer_plan: buffer_id→std_buffer_id\n\n프론트:\n- Demand Ver Input에 실시간 중복 검사 rules 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dca48fbb1da2b69f08ac7f882822b6edafcab50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/7dca48fbb1da2b69f08ac7f882822b6edafcab50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/b75d74467f7b86e3cf725dec0f82a19538e02e8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{