 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2112ad05d2fc47de21f9b9338eb054008c608a4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/2112ad05d2fc47de21f9b9338eb054008c608a4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/8ea5ccdc42712bc36dcfb9a0f8e9d94425c9b786","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/8ea5ccdc42712bc36dcfb9a0f8e9d94425c9b786","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDhlYTVjY2RjNDI3MTJiYzM2ZGNmYjlhMGY4ZTlkOTQ0MjVjOWI3ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01","sha":"e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01"}],"sha":"8ea5ccdc42712bc36dcfb9a0f8e9d94425c9b786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/8ea5ccdc42712bc36dcfb9a0f8e9d94425c9b786"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T07:34:55Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T07:34:55Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: Plan Dashboard Sub4/Sub5/Sub6 전면 수정\n\nSub4/Sub6 (OTD Summary):\n- otdSummary → otdSummaryAct + otdSummaryPlan 분리 (APS 원본 별도 API)\n- rpt_buffer_plan: out_plan_conv_qty → in_plan_conv_qty (입고 기준)\n- buffer JOIN: std_buffer_id 사용\n- productionArea 필터: DEMAND_REGION(PROP02) → PRODUCTION_AREA(PROP01)\n- demand_type 필터 제거 (C# 원본에 없음), null category 제외\n- DEMANDTYPE: demand_type → prod_type(prop_json PROP03) 그룹핑\n- actual SQL: project_id, inout_type, oper_id IS NULL 필터\n- radio(제품구분/생산유형) → /otd-summary API 독립 호출\n- 그리드: item_group별 월초+실적/재수립 2행 병합 (enableCellMerge)\n- 컬럼: 전월/당월/차월/차월이후/합계 + 유형 컬럼\n- radio 전환 시 로딩 스피너\n- APEX region 옵션 추가\n\nSub5 (공정 부하율):\n- SQL: C# OperGroupStrRate_Total 완전 포팅\n  std_ts 보정, UOM 분기(uomPropID), 2단계 집계\n- operGroupIDs: widget config dict 키 파싱 + C# 기본값 9개\n- 정렬: widget priority 순서\n- 차트: dataZoom으로 5개씩 표시 + 스크롤\n\n기타:\n- planVer 빈값 시 토스트 표시\n- get_rpt_prop_config 레포지토리 메서드 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96601e9aa137db07d831f9880d2f7d2783e2c8e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/96601e9aa137db07d831f9880d2f7d2783e2c8e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKGU5YzQzZDQ1MWNlYWY2MjY0YTVkMjA5Zjc4YjNlNmQ4N2E3MDNhMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49","sha":"ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49"}],"sha":"e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/e9c43d451ceaf6264a5d209f78b3e6d87a703a01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T02:06:37Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T02:06:37Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: Plan Dashboard Sub1~3 데이터 + i18n 전면 수정\n\nSub2 (생산 실적의 납기 준수율):\n- _get_rtf_summary_on_frozen_and_act를 C# GetRTFSummaryFromAct 기반 재구현\n  ope_exec_actual에서 실적 조회 → demand별 short/upcoming 분류\n- FINAL_ITEM_BUFFER_SQL: ODV_REPORT_STD_BUFFER_CONFIG → odv_buffer_master\n  (원본 C# OdvBufferMaster 사용, final_item_buffer_yn=''y'')\n- OTD_EXEC_ACTUAL_SQL: partition_key→project_id, in_out_type→inout_type\n  (PG 스키마 컬럼명 차이)\n- demand 쿼리: C# 원본 SQL 완전 재현\n  SafetyStock 제외 안함(원본에 없음), #Dummy만 제외,\n  due_date < cycleEnd (strict <), DEMAND_REGION LIKE 필터\n\nSub3 (재수립 계획의 납기 준수율):\n- C# GetRTFSummary(!isFrozenVer) 로직 포팅\n  1) 먼저 actual 기반 short/upcoming 계산\n  2) plan index에서 early/ontime/late 가져옴\n  3) adjustedShort = (actShort+actUpcoming) - (planOntime+planLate)\n\ni18n:\n- Sub1 \"(월 기준)\" → \"(04월 기준)\": fromDate에서 월 추출\n- \"RTF 비율\" → \"납기 준수율\"\n- 소수점 toFixed(2) → toFixed(1)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1215fb6bdaf8861f75e950715567fd8b58fd4e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/1215fb6bdaf8861f75e950715567fd8b58fd4e1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKGVjNGM0ZGJiNDBmODUxODQxOWY0OWIyNmI5N2ZiOTI1ZGE4MTRmNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/df40e7b870fa1e4f8c4f4adb2c2bc430b8323f52","sha":"df40e7b870fa1e4f8c4f4adb2c2bc430b8323f52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/df40e7b870fa1e4f8c4f4adb2c2bc430b8323f52"}],"sha":"ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/ec4c4dbb40f8518419f49b26b97fb925da814f49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/df40e7b870fa1e4f8c4f4adb2c2bc430b8323f52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T07:50:50Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T07:50:50Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: RTF 현황 페이지 전면 수정 — 필드 바인딩, SQL, 에러 처리\n\n프론트엔드:\n- Sub1/Sub2/Sub3 그리드 바인딩을 백엔드 camelCase 응답에 맞춤\n  (demand_id→demandID, rtf_ratio→rtfRatio 등 전체 필드)\n- 필터 드롭다운 key-prop을 API 응답 필드에 맞춤\n  (item_group_id→item_group, site_id→value, demand_type→value)\n- group_name 필드를 summaryType 기반으로 동적 매핑\n- Sub2 Short 팝업 바인딩 수정 + 누락 컬럼 추가\n- Sub3 prodDetailData에서 detail 배열만 추출 (Object→Array 타입 오류)\n- prodDetailLoading 상태 추가 + API 에러 시 무한 로딩 방지\n\n백엔드:\n- get_prop_ids: prop_json 파싱으로 DEMAND_REGION 우선 조회 (C# 동작 일치)\n- json_parse 오류: json_format()으로 json→varchar 변환 (Trino PG 커넥터 호환)\n- 빈 {} JSON 필터링: 서브쿼리로 UNNEST 전 사전 제외\n- REST 스타일 라우트 별칭 추가 (summary, detail, short 등)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23d6d4a6fd51176dbab7a016629bc59a8bccbb3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/23d6d4a6fd51176dbab7a016629bc59a8bccbb3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/df40e7b870fa1e4f8c4f4adb2c2bc430b8323f52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"}