포인트 추가\n\nrtf-report 페이지는 아래 4종 필터를 GET으로 호출하지만 백엔드에 핸들러가\n없어서 catch-all POST 라우터에 매칭되어 405 Method Not Allowed 반환.\n\n추가한 엔드포인트:\n- GET /rtf-report/filters/regions       (DEMAND_REGION 우선, PRODUCTION_AREA 폴백)\n- GET /rtf-report/filters/demand-types\n- GET /rtf-report/filters/prod-types    (PROD_TYPE prop_json 기반)\n- GET /rtf-report/filters/prop-columns  (상세 그리드 동적 컬럼 정의)\n\n공통 헬퍼 _load_rpt_prop_config / _find_prop_key로 prop_json 파싱 로직 재사용.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"105fe9e126718397c3bfe16f4f1316e4dddfaffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/105fe9e126718397c3bfe16f4f1316e4dddfaffa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/8218de15f919ea5d3b237e0e9d5f2c5b112bb3a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/8218de15f919ea5d3b237e0e9d5f2c5b112bb3a3","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT