 속성)를 찾도록 되어 있어 HK 선택 시 결과가 전부 누락됨.\n\n_load_prop_keys에서 DEMAND_REGION → PRODUCTION_AREA 순으로 조회하도록\n우선순위 변경. APS 응답 메타 productionAreaPropID와 동작 일치 확인 완료.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eeeda3261956a5a44e290b90498bb0396c86960a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/eeeda3261956a5a44e290b90498bb0396c86960a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/c13e91289677df3b7d79803e7e281ad49a641bc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/c13e91289677df3b7d79803e7e281ad49a641bc1","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKGMxM2U5MTI4OTY3N2RmM2I3ZDc5ODAzZTdlMjgxYWQ0OWE2NDFiYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/12b6585068f406fd968d671f1a992c8f787df013","sha":"12b6585068f406fd968d671f1a992c8f787df013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templ