url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/792cecfa4d9b7936e92dbec5a84ce768ac7d9eea","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDc5MmNlY2ZhNGQ5Yjc5MzZlOTJkYmVjNWE4NGNlNzY4YWM3ZDllZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/7edc767cd9f59c6c8c24d0369d2fc7757af06cfe","sha":"7edc767cd9f59c6c8c24d0369d2fc7757af06cfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7edc767cd9f59c6c8c24d0369d2fc7757af06cfe"}],"sha":"792cecfa4d9b7936e92dbec5a84ce768ac7d9eea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/792cecfa4d9b7936e92dbec5a84ce768ac7d9eea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/7edc767cd9f59c6c8c24d0369d2fc7757af06cfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T00:04:58Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T00:04:58Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Feat: BomMap Trino 직접 구현 + 백엔드 전면 개선\n\nBE:\n- BomMap 서비스 신규 구현 (bom_map.py) — C# 프록시 제거, Trino 직접 쿼리\n  - out_bom_network_info + rpt_demand_plan_isb + OUT_SHORT_LOG\n  - SetBomPathLog 로직 (path_yn/to_path_yn) C# 동일 구현\n  - ISB 수량 병합, onlyTargetBom 필터\n- Trino 카탈로그 분리 (TRINO_PG_CATALOG=postgresql, TRINO_CATALOG_ICEBERG=iceberg)\n- execute_query %s → f-string 전환 (Trino 호환)\n- ReplanRtf totalQty 계산 버그 수정\n- ReplanRtf prop_json 동적 조회 + 필터 추가\n- RE oper-groups 테이블 odv_oper_group_master로 변경\n- rtf-report/filters/customers,item-groups GET 엔드포인트 (Iceberg 직접)\n- Mock 모드 (USE_MOCK=true) + 캡처 스크립트\n- Short Log SQL 컬럼 alias 소문자 명시\n- extend_target_datetime 컬럼명 수정\n\nFE:\n- Sub2 팝업: BomMapInterface + SplitPane 구조 (원본 동일)\n- bomMapShortLogs 분리 (bomMap API shortLogs → 하단 그리드 + BomMapInterface)\n- 팝업 리사이즈 (80%×90%), Short 그리드 11개 컬럼\n- BomMap 번역 키 76개 추가 (ko.ts)\n- itemGroupSource null 필터링 + key-prop 수정\n- shortLoading 상태 관리\n- wijmo.vue2.grid.multirow alias 설정\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b3fb4d25ab73f773d2469bc7cc8726bbf370711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/6b3fb4d25ab73f773d2469bc7cc8726bbf370711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/7edc767cd9f59c6c8c24d0369d2fc7757af06cfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon