ud/custom-ui-templates/commit/3108e07b78a6081f1c7bd9a20c450073f5bc8b01","sha":"3108e07b78a6081f1c7bd9a20c450073f5bc8b01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/3108e07b78a6081f1c7bd9a20c450073f5bc8b01"}],"sha":"0dd45cd8828c436ffa24e24d6bc043817dcd2a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/0dd45cd8828c436ffa24e24d6bc043817dcd2a66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/3108e07b78a6081f1c7bd9a20c450073f5bc8b01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T07:08:32Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T07:08:32Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Fix: 백엔드 전체 API 원본 동일 응답 검증 및 수정\n\n- BE: Trino 카탈로그 분리 (postgresql: 설정 테이블, iceberg: 데이터 테이블)\n- BE: execute_query %s 파라미터 바인딩 → f-string (Trino 호환)\n- BE: ReplanRtf totalQty 계산 버그 수정 (조정된 shortQty 사용, C# DTO 동일)\n- BE: ReplanRtf prop_json 동적 조회 (prod_type, production_area)\n- BE: ReplanRtf 필터 파라미터 추가 (customers, itemGroupIDs, prodTypes, productionArea)\n- BE: RE oper-groups 테이블 odv_oper_group_master로 변경 (원본 동일)\n- BE: rtf-report/filters/customers, item-groups GET 엔드포인트 추가 (Iceberg 직접)\n- BE: plan_dashboard repository %s → f-string 전환\n- FE: Sub2 팝업 BomMapInterface + SplitPane 구조 (원본 동일)\n- FE: Sub2 Short 그리드 컬럼 11개로 확장 (원본 동일)\n- FE: 팝업 리사이즈 가능 (80%x90%)\n- FE: itemGroupSource null 필터링 + key-prop 수정\n- FE: shortLoading 상태 관리 추가\n\n검증: 5개 페이지 12개 API 전수 비교 — count/values 모두 원본과 일치\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d96b83757897e3dc7377d0f359635440d5626ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/d96b83757897e3dc7377d0f359635440d5626ffe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/3108e07b78a6081f1c7bd9a20c450073f5bc8b01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/comm