.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/f6e3c606191c53cdf74907b298d21fb81c743a8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T01:19:47Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T01:19:47Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Refactor: APS C# API를 BE 프록시 방식으로 전환\n\n- FE에서 /api/aps/backend/ 직접 호출 제거 → BE /proxy/ 경유\n- aps_proxy.py: httpx로 C# API 중계 (Cookie/Auth 헤더 전달)\n- C# API HTTP 메서드 원본 APS와 동일하게 매핑:\n  - GET: PlanCycleInfo, ExecutionFlowMaster, ScenarioMaster,\n         PlmPlanExecute/Inbound, PlmPlanExecute, MdmDemandVer\n  - POST: OdlReport, ScenarioConfig, ScenarioModules, ComDemandVer,\n          MdmDemandVer/GetLastRev, ReExecutePlan, SaveWidget\n- config.py: APS_BACKEND_BASE_URL 환경변수 추가\n- Vite proxy /api/aps/backend 제거 (불필요)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbf47a825e7fd5e0fbd1f880b26064055891422e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/bbf47a825e7fd5e0fbd1f880b26064055891422e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/f6e3c606191c53cdf74907b298d21fb81c743a8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://ap