os/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/9642fb84d71a055a02ad45335e6443b0a050722f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T08:46:33Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T08:46:33Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Feat: 계획 재실행 (ReExecutePlan) 구현\n\nBE:\n- re-execute-plan API 8개 (main, regions, oper-groups, buffers, opers, customers, item-groups, demand-types)\n- rpt_oper_group_plan, rpt_buffer_plan, odv_demand 기반 Trino SQL\n- null 필터 자동 제거, demand_group_id 컬럼명 매핑\n\nFE:\n- 메인 (Controller + SplitPane: PivotGrid + FlexGrid)\n- ReExecutePlanPop (2단계 위저드: 수요 확인 → 엔진 재실행)\n- ReExecutePlanWidgetPop (위젯 설정)\n- C# APS API 직접 호출 (/api/aps/backend/ 경로)\n  - PlmExecutionFlowMaster, PlmScenarioMaster, PlmPlanExecute,\n    OdlReport, ComDemandVer, MdmDemandVer 등\n- 가짜 API 제거 (GetPlanVerInfo → PlmPlanExecute GET)\n- 팝업 닫기 + breadcrumb props 수정\n- Vite proxy: /api/aps/backend → APS_API_TARGET 추가\n- i18n 다국어 키 추가 (한글 리터럴 키 포함)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"638c250958d90a6432870d7cd4ec07e176d565ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/638c250958d90a6432870d7cd4ec07e176d565ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/9642fb84d71a055a02ad45335e6443b0a050722f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","orga