oud/custom-ui-templates/commit/73272896c06fbd5626af165218533fc9da5ad4aa","node_id":"C_kwDOQpsGT9oAKDczMjcyODk2YzA2ZmJkNTYyNmFmMTY1MjE4NTMzZmM5ZGE1YWQ0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/8c661c025cf8adf5d09485246d03af847fc9645c","sha":"8c661c025cf8adf5d09485246d03af847fc9645c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/8c661c025cf8adf5d09485246d03af847fc9645c"}],"sha":"73272896c06fbd5626af165218533fc9da5ad4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/73272896c06fbd5626af165218533fc9da5ad4aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commits/8c661c025cf8adf5d09485246d03af847fc9645c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T08:43:46Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T08:43:46Z","email":"hawonkim@vms-solutions.com","name":"Curtiss"},"message":"Feat: 재수립 계획 납기 준수 현황 (OnTimeRescheduledPlanResult) 구현\n\nBE:\n- replan-rtf API (summary, detail, prod-detail, filters)\n- freeze-plan API (확정/취소/설명수정)\n- Trino ope_exec_actual 쿼리 수정 (partition_key→project_id, inout_type)\n- datetime/date 타입 비교 오류 수정\n- plan_dashboard_queries PLAN_CONFIG_DATES_SQL JOIN 수정\n\nFE:\n- 메인 페이지 + Sub1(요약) + Sub2(상세) + Detail(피벗) + WidgetPop(설정)\n- WjFlexGridColumnGroup 2단 그룹 헤더 (RTF 비율, 생산 수량)\n- ratio_rtf/rtfQty 서브텍스트 formatItem 구현\n- 조회조건 flex-wrap 레이아웃 + radio nowrap 수정\n- i18n 다국어 적용 (APS 원본 키 체계 동일)\n- ko.ts 번역 리소스 + i18n 플러그인 연결\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d19c9dfbee775183049a8564c42a8641b6f709f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/trees/d19c9dfbee775183049a8564c42a8641b6f709f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/git/commits/8c661c025cf8adf5d09485246d03af847fc9645c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121479339?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vms-hawon","id":121479339,"login":"vms-hawon","node_id":"U_kgDOBz2gqw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vms-hawon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vmscloud/custom-ui-templates/commit/8c661c025cf8adf5d