ibility issues across the\napplication. The form now properly supports both create and edit modes with\nname-based user identification.","tree":{"sha":"da5fc4b917a1d5d45609539130228a655e5224d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jaume-Molet/recipe-client-onboarding/git/trees/da5fc4b917a1d5d45609539130228a655e5224d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jaume-Molet/recipe-client-onboarding/git/commits/509046ebe333a6bd2b2d3942432cff0455a2c9d2","verification":{"payload":"tree da5fc4b917a1d5d45609539130228a655e5224d3\nparent 7b14aa7ae0144db14d955d967ddba0402c6a4116\nauthor Jaume-Molet <jaume.molet@perk.com> 1768311603 +0100\ncommitter Jaume-Molet <jaume.molet@perk.com> 1768311603 +0100\n\nfeat: update recipe form to use author name and improve UI\n\n- Change recipe creation/update to use author_name (string) instead of author_id (UUID)\n- Update API client and DTOs to use author_name and requester_name\n- Fix text visibility issues by updating CSS for proper light/dark mode support\n- Convert TextInput component from styled-components to CSS modules\n- Update FormattedText CSS module with proper text color variants for accessibility\n- Make author name field editable in edit mode (used as requester name for authorization)\n- Add helper text in edit mode explaining requester name requirement\n- Update all tests to use name-based APIs\n- Fix RecipeDetail to use author_name for deletion\n\nThis improves user experience by allowing users to enter their name instead\nof requiring UUID knowledge, and fixes text visibility issues across the\napplication. The form now properly supports both create and edit modes with\nname-based user identification.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgdEOnUm48QrPJLjZ0P2m2d7BbAn\no3Tra4kGr9+n5KjeMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJn52JV3r2z9xKerXhJG4zzwOcZ+EuNvkHQ3C0oEtybextOkvMQ8LbYzLxn9SqhvDQ\npNyXffv0BkCbFtg2x1PAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",