or Flex compatibility\n\n- Replace TextInput with self-contained implementation:\n  * Remove dependency on non-existent SuitcaseInternalTextInput\n  * Create types.ts with TextInputProps interface matching RecipeForm usage\n  * Implement using styled-components with design tokens for consistent styling\n  * Support all required props: value, onChange, disabled, required, etc.\n\nThis fixes the import errors preventing the app from running.","tree":{"sha":"c7cdf85b29ca8ad9b794a87aa2e24ecae8fb2fcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jaume-Molet/recipe-client-onboarding/git/trees/c7cdf85b29ca8ad9b794a87aa2e24ecae8fb2fcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jaume-Molet/recipe-client-onboarding/git/commits/371d70084d6fe290d864d19b5c9d64cfa7451a13","verification":{"payload":"tree c7cdf85b29ca8ad9b794a87aa2e24ecae8fb2fcc\nparent e30688d93d6267123f39910d83ce01fefcf4b7c5\nauthor Jaume-Molet <jaume.molet@perk.com> 1768223288 +0100\ncommitter Jaume-Molet <jaume.molet@perk.com> 1768223288 +0100\n\nfix: add missing Suitcase token files and implement TextInput component\n\n- Create missing design token files:\n  * css-variable-accessors.ts with dt object (spacing, borderRadius, fontSizes, colors)\n  * mock-css-variable-values.ts with mockDt for testing\n  * types.ts with SpacingKey, BorderRadiusKey, FontSizeKey type definitions\n  * spacingDimensionKeys.ts with isSpacingDimensionKey utility function\n  * rebrandTypography.ts with rebrandTypescale for FormattedText component\n  * Support both direct access (dt.dimensions[''1x'']) and nested access for Flex compatibility\n\n- Replace TextInput with self-contained implementation:\n  * Remove dependency on non-existent SuitcaseInternalTextInput\n  * Create types.ts with TextInputProps interface matching RecipeForm usage\n  * Implement using styled-components with design tokens for consistent styling\n  * Support all required props: value, onChange, disabled, required, etc.\n\nThis fixes the import errors preventing the app from run