freflix@gmail.com","name":"João Victor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-14T02:09:24Z","email":"offreflix@gmail.com","name":"João Victor"},"message":"feat(dashboard): add year overview to calendar view\n\nImplement a new \"year\" view option in the finance calendar dashboard. The view includes a bar chart visualization of monthly income/expense, an annual calendar with monthly balances, and summary totals. This provides users with a high-level overview of their financial performance across the entire year.\n\n- Add new API endpoint `/dashboard/year` to fetch aggregated year data\n- Create `DashboardYearOverview` and `DashboardYearOverviewMonth` types\n- Implement `YearOverviewChart` component for bar chart visualization\n- Implement `AnnualCalendar` component showing monthly calendar grids with balances\n- Extend `CalendarView` component with a view selector (day/week/month/year/agenda/4days)\n- Update backend service with `getYearOverview` method to calculate monthly aggregates","tree":{"sha":"6638012e83638e731cc78f3e3d7613ffd3d41fac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/offreflix/sbn-monorepo/git/trees/6638012e83638e731cc78f3e3d7613ffd3d41fac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/offreflix/sbn-monorepo/git/commits/d2b68816a5ad4519f18f654e26cb756dff45dec8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91212364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/offreflix","id":91212364,"login":"offreflix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMjEyMzY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.