e main server logic in sbn_mcp/server.py using FastMCP.\n- Registered financial tools (dashboard, transactions, wallets, categories, recurrences, projections, wishlist) in the MCP server.\n- Created tools for managing categories, including listing, creating, updating, and deleting categories.\n- Developed dashboard tools for financial summaries and category breakdowns.\n- Implemented projections tool for financial forecasting.\n- Created recurrences tool for managing recurring transactions.\n- Developed transactions tool for CRUD operations on financial transactions.\n- Implemented wallets tool for managing user wallets.\n- Created wishlist tool for managing wishlist items.\n- Added utility functions for converting keys from snake_case to camelCase.\n- Updated pnpm-lock.yaml with new dependencies for testing and coverage.","tree":{"sha":"833f0d368c555c75df58f16276a6806357911046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/offreflix/sbn-monorepo/git/trees/833f0d368c555c75df58f16276a6806357911046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/offreflix/sbn-monorepo/git/commits/771b6929484d6524e1ad5a152e133ffd07d32fde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91212364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/offreflix","id":91212364,"login":"offreflix","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMjEyMzY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/offreflix/starre