er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h15629526027","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aposseadesse/nextjs-monolith-extraction-pattern/commits/6b5f65de3c37900d68f7dc949397b9681bbf2514/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-16T20:48:13Z","email":"your.email@example.com","name":"Your Name"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-16T20:48:13Z","email":"your.email@example.com","name":"Your Name"},"message":"Add Next.js Monolith Extraction Pattern - Professional PoC\n\nThis repository demonstrates proven architectural patterns for decomposing\nNext.js monoliths into service-oriented micro-frontends.\n\nFeatures:\n- Multi-tenant platform architecture with company isolation\n- Cross-domain JWT authentication with AsyncLocalStorage scoping\n- Shared TypeScript definitions for type safety across services\n- Production-ready middleware patterns for request isolation\n- Complete folder structure for 4-service decomposition\n\nBased on real-world experience extracting enterprise platforms.","tree":{"sha":"545aeb6b4007b245c3a568ad4d2a0ffc097d26e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aposseadesse/nextjs-monolith-extraction-pattern/git/trees/545aeb6b4007b245c3a568ad4d2a0ffc097d26e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aposseadesse/nextjs-monolith-extraction-pattern/git/commits/6b5f65de3c37900d68f7dc949397b9681bbf2514","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99627554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h15629526027/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h15629526027/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h15629526027/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h15629526027/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/h15629526027","id":99627554,"login":"h15629526027","node_id":"U_kgDOBfAyIg","organizat