s prevents invalid drags\n- Color-coded edges: blue=depends_on, purple=volume, green=network, orange=env\n- Config summary chips on service nodes (ports, env, volumes count)\n- Edge IDs include handle info for precise connection tracking\n- buildNodeData() syncs display data with config changes\n\nService Template Catalog (Phase 11):\n- 18 pre-built templates: Postgres, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis, MariaDB, Nginx,\n  Traefik, Caddy, Node.js, Python, Go, RabbitMQ, Grafana, Prometheus,\n  MinIO, WordPress, Elasticsearch, Custom\n- Searchable sidebar with category accordion (Database, Web Server, Runtime,\n  Messaging, Monitoring, Storage, Application, Search, Generic)\n- Click template → adds fully configured node with image, ports, env, volumes\n- Infrastructure blocks (Volume, Network, Environment) in compact bottom row\n\nYAML Generator:\n- Rewrote to use handle-based edge types instead of bidirectional adjacency\n- Backward compatible with legacy edges (no handle info)\n\nTests: 39 frontend (14 composerSlice) + 12 backend = 51 total passing","tree":{"sha":"4f7696a8f42fd8510b95ccc5145d1fca1c308e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/trees/4f7696a8f42fd8510b95ccc5145d1fca1c308e24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/commits/7dc6bf3572a91abfac24bbe899d93fedf1eaf652","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76741960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yosef-Adel","id":76741960,"login":"Yosef-Adel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzQxOTYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel