s_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/commits/09a2234ae97bab4e3500420096623cca26d8cac6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T11:43:08Z","email":"yosefadel002@gmail.com","name":"Yosef Adel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T11:43:08Z","email":"yosefadel002@gmail.com","name":"Yosef Adel"},"message":"feat(backend): phase 2 — API hardening, exception filter, audit logging, token rotation\n\n- Add global exception filter with consistent error shape (statusCode, message, error, timestamp, path, requestId)\n- Add request ID middleware (UUID per request, forwarded via x-request-id header)\n- Add API versioning with global prefix /api/v1/ (health endpoints excluded)\n- Add response envelope interceptor (all responses wrapped in {statusCode, data, message})\n- Add health check endpoints (/health, /health/ready) using @nestjs/terminus with MongoDB ping\n- Add MongoDB indexes on isEmailVerified, roles, createdAt, deletedAt\n- Configure Mongoose connection pool (maxPoolSize: 10, socketTimeoutMS: 45s)\n- Implement refresh token rotation (new access + refresh token pair on each refresh)\n- Detect token reuse and invalidate all tokens on suspicious refresh\n- Add soft delete to User schema (deletedAt field, filtered from all queries)\n- Add pagination to admin GET /users endpoint (page, limit, total)\n- Create AuditLog schema and service — logs login, logout, token refresh events\n- Audit logs auto-expire after 90 days via MongoDB TTL index","tree":{"sha":"f78d086ab875125c44318ee92019ae7cd0d6d5ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/trees/f78d086ab875125c44318ee92019ae7cd0d6d5ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/commits/09a2234ae97bab4e3500420096623cca26d8cac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76741960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c