om/users/Yosef-Adel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/commits/e88d8a6497f96a4ff4b44ace647c469a837a9ae4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:45:36Z","email":"yosefadel002@gmail.com","name":"Yosef Adel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:45:36Z","email":"yosefadel002@gmail.com","name":"Yosef Adel"},"message":"feat: rewrite composer dashboard — fix state management, add properties panel\n\nRoot causes fixed:\n- Edges were only stored in ReactFlow local state (never synced to Redux),\n  so deleting a node or any Redux re-render wiped all connections\n- No properties panel existed — clicking a node did nothing visible\n- YAML generator ignored edge connections entirely\n\nArchitecture changes:\n- Redux is now the single source of truth for nodes AND edges\n- ReactFlow runs in controlled mode (no useNodesState/useEdgesState)\n- All changes (move, connect, delete) dispatch to Redux immediately\n- Node deletions in Redux automatically clean up edges and configs\n\nNew features:\n- PropertiesPanel: right-side panel for editing selected node config\n  - Service: image, command, restart policy, ports, env vars, volumes\n  - Volume: name, driver\n  - Network: name, driver\n  - Environment: name, key-value variables\n  - Delete node button\n- YAML generator now uses edge connections to automatically link\n  volumes/networks/env-groups to services they''re connected to\n- Clicking canvas background deselects the active node\n- Keyboard delete (Backspace/Delete) support for nodes","tree":{"sha":"1bc672951fd20a9b677b8a7d44ad8a5473a18bb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/trees/1bc672951fd20a9b677b8a7d44ad8a5473a18bb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/commits/e88d8a6497f96a4ff4b44ace647c469a837a9ae4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76741960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yosef-Adel","id":76741960,"login":"Yosef-Adel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzQxOTYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Yosef-Adel/composable/commit/e88d8a6497f96a4ff4b44ace647c469a837a9ae4","node_id":"C_kwDOQqBZLtoAKGU4OGQ4YTY0OTdmOTZhNGZmNGI0NGFjZTY0N2M0NjlhODM3YTlhZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Yosef-Adel/composable/commit/9b4fa8cdc55bba92e280d87266c85c376ea414a6","sha":"9b4fa8cdc55bba92e280d87266c85c376ea414a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/commits/9b4fa8cdc55bba92e280d87266c85c376ea414a6"}],"sha":"e88d8a6497f96a4ff4b44ace647c469a837a9ae4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/commits/e88d8a6497f96a4ff4b44ace647c469a837a9ae4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76741960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yosef-Adel","id":76741960,"login":"Yosef-Adel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzQxOTYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/commits/9b4fa8cdc55bba92e280d87266c85c376ea414a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:36:12Z","email":"yosefadel002@gmail.com","name":"Yosef Adel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:36:12Z","email":"yosefadel002@gmail.com","name":"Yosef Adel"},"message":"fix: resolve all TypeScript errors and logic bugs across codebase\n\nFrontend fixes:\n- Fix AuthPage: replace blind setTimeout navigation with useEffect on isAuthenticated\n- Fix composerSlice: use blockType instead of hardcoded ''service'' for node types\n- Fix DashboardPage: register all ReactFlow node types (volume, network, environment)\n- Fix ProjectsPage: update Grid API from MUI v6 to v7 (item→size prop)\n- Fix Header: guard against empty user.name with optional chaining\n- Fix authSlice: replace dispatch:any with AppDispatch type\n- Fix NavItem: add displayName and fix Link component type\n- Fix tsconfig.json: add vite/client types for import.meta.env\n- Fix yamlGenerator: prefix unused edges parameter\n\nBackend fixes:\n- Fix user.schema.ts: remove redundant @Prop decorators for timestamps fields\n- Fix auth.controller.ts + admin.controller.ts: serialize ObjectId with .toString()\n- Fix auth.service.ts: add TTL cleanup for otpResendAttempts map (memory leak)\n- Fix auth.service.ts: properly type roles parameter as UserRole[]\n- Fix verify-otp.dto.ts: add @IsMongoId() validation on userId\n\nUI-Kit fixes:\n- Fix 11 theme component files: Number() cast on borderRadius arithmetic\n- Fix TextField: change interface to type alias for union type extension\n- Fix Tabs: remove unused imports, prefix unused event, cast icon type\n- Fix Label/styles: cast mainChannel access, fix borderRadius arithmetic\n- Fix CustomPopover/styles: cast blackChannel access\n- Fix EmptyIllustration: add sx prop support\n- Fix Table/utils: null-safe comparator values\n- Fix Chart/use-chart: fix 3 invalid ApexCharts type assertions\n- Fix Radio/Select: remove unused ReactNode imports","tree":{"sha":"368216dbd7b338d92f83a09c44523d807b06d393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/trees/368216dbd7b338d92f83a09c44523d807b06d393"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yosef-Adel/composable/git/commits/9b4fa8cdc55bba92e280d87266c85c376ea414a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76741960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yosef-Adel","id":76741960,"login":"Yosef-Adel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzQxOTYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yosef-Adel/received_events","repos_url":"