ines with distributed systems depth:\n\nQ1: Communication Patterns - Sync/async, HTTP/REST, gRPC, circuit breaker, bulkhead\nQ2: Service Discovery - Consul architecture, API gateway, rate limiting, load balancing\nQ3: Service Mesh - Istio/Envoy, data/control plane, traffic management, mTLS\nQ4: Container Orchestration - Kubernetes architecture, pods, services, HPA, Helm\nQ5: API Versioning - Strategies, semantic versioning, contract testing, evolution\nQ6: Distributed Tracing - OpenTelemetry, Jaeger/Zipkin, sampling, context propagation\nQ7: Saga Pattern - Orchestration vs choreography, compensating transactions, isolation\nQ8: Event-Driven - Event sourcing, CQRS, eventual consistency, event versioning\nQ9: Data Consistency - CAP theorem, 2PC vs Saga, distributed locks, idempotency\nQ10: Security - Zero trust, OAuth/OIDC, JWT, API keys, secret management\n\nAdded distributed systems concepts:\n- Consensus algorithms (Raft, Paxos)\n- Vector clocks and conflict resolution\n- Bloom filters and probabilistic data structures\n- Network partitions and split-brain scenarios\n\nProduction-ready implementations for all patterns","tree":{"sha":"46656748e5b295bdcf72bb05a4893d881008069c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salman01010/fullstack-developer/git/trees/46656748e5b295bdcf72bb05a4893d881008069c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salman01010/fullstack-developer/git/commits/8f7c9a9211743d84e502ae745932003f7266fede","verification":{"payload":"tree 46656748e5b295bdcf72bb05a4893d881008069c\nparent b7d02d04861f762ace3a42b65684d9c5db92cac1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766432721 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1766432721 +0000\n\nAdd comprehensive theory to Microservices Architecture questions\n\nEnhanced from 772 to 4,741+ lines with distributed systems depth:\n\nQ1: Communication Patterns - Sync/async, HTTP/REST, gRPC, circuit breaker, bulkhead\nQ2: Service Discovery - Consul architecture, API gateway, rate limiting, load balancing\nQ3: Service